    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-2a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2A Application of Act to Commonwealth and Commonwealth",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-2a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "authorities\n\n(1) Subject to this section and sections 44AC, 44E and 95D, this Act\nbinds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth in so far as the\nCrown in right of the Commonwealth carries on a business, either\ndirectly or by an authority of the Commonwealth.\n\n(2) Subject to the succeeding provisions of this section, this Act\napplies as if:\n\n(a) the Commonwealth, in so far as it carries on a business\notherwise than by an authority of the Commonwealth; and\n\n(b) each authority of the Commonwealth (whether or not acting\nas an agent of the Crown in right of the Commonwealth) in\nso far as it carries on a business;\nwere a corporation.\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
      "skos:definition": "authorities\n\n(1) Subject to this section and sections 44AC, 44E and 95D, this Act\nbinds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth in so far as the\nCrown in right of the Commonwealth carries on a business, either\ndirectly or by an authority of the Commonwealth.\n\n(2) Subject to the succeeding provisions of this section, this Act\napplies as if:\n\n(a) the Commonwealth, in so far as it carries on a business\notherwise than by an authority of the Commonwealth; and\n\n(b) each authority of the Commonwealth (whether or not acting\nas an agent of the Crown in right of the Commonwealth) in\nso far as it carries on a business;\nwere a corporation.\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-2a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-2a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9756757b8c6dd29422388434c0fda529a4a8b5bc95d590808b958a1d60325117"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-2a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2A Application of Act to Commonwealth and Commonwealth",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "authorities\n\n(1) Subject to this section and sections 44AC, 44E and 95D, this Act\nbinds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth in so far as the\nCrown in right of the Commonwealth carries on a business, either\ndirectly or by an authority of the Commonwealth.\n\n(2) Subject to the succeeding provisions of this section, this Act\napplies as if:\n\n(a) the Commonwealth, in so far as it carries on a business\notherwise than by an authority of the Commonwealth; and\n\n(b) each authority of the Commonwealth (whether or not acting\nas an agent of the Crown in right of the Commonwealth) in\nso far as it carries on a business;\nwere a corporation.\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary"
    },
