    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-2c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2C Activities that are not business",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-2c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.31",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of sections 2A, 2B and 2BA, the following do not\namount to carrying on a business:\n\n(a) imposing or collecting:\n\n(i) taxes; or\n\n(ii) levies; or\n\n(iii) fees for licences;\n\n(b) granting, refusing to grant, revoking, suspending or varying\nlicences (whether or not they are subject to conditions);\n\n(c) a transaction involving:\n\n(i) only persons who are all acting for the Crown in the\nsame right (and none of whom is an authority of the\nCommonwealth or an authority of a State or Territory);\nor\n\n(ii) only persons who are all acting for the same authority of\nthe Commonwealth; or\n\n(iii) only persons who are all acting for the same authority of\na State or Territory; or\n\n(iv) only the Crown in right of the Commonwealth and one\nor more non-commercial authorities of the\nCommonwealth; or\n\n(v) only the Crown in right of a State or Territory and one\nor more non-commercial authorities of that State or\nTerritory; or\n\n(vi) only non-commercial authorities of the Commonwealth;\nor\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of sections 2A, 2B and 2BA, the following do not\namount to carrying on a business:\n\n(a) imposing or collecting:\n\n(i) taxes; or\n\n(ii) levies; or\n\n(iii) fees for licences;\n\n(b) granting, refusing to grant, revoking, suspending or varying\nlicences (whether or not they are subject to conditions);\n\n(c) a transaction involving:\n\n(i) only persons who are all acting for the Crown in the\nsame right (and none of whom is an authority of the\nCommonwealth or an authority of a State or Territory);\nor\n\n(ii) only persons who are all acting for the same authority of\nthe Commonwealth; or\n\n(iii) only persons who are all acting for the same authority of\na State or Territory; or\n\n(iv) only the Crown in right of the Commonwealth and one\nor more non-commercial authorities of the\nCommonwealth; or\n\n(v) only the Crown in right of a State or Territory and one\nor more non-commercial authorities of that State or\nTerritory; or\n\n(vi) only non-commercial authorities of the Commonwealth;\nor\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-2c-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-2c-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bcde65b0ba388a8d18267031c9f6e4f51b840adeb44b11462da164e4711f30d7",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions from business activities for certain government entities"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-2c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2C Activities that are not business",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 31,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of sections 2A, 2B and 2BA, the following do not\namount to carrying on a business:\n\n(a) imposing or collecting:\n\n(i) taxes; or\n\n(ii) levies; or\n\n(iii) fees for licences;\n\n(b) granting, refusing to grant, revoking, suspending or varying\nlicences (whether or not they are subject to conditions);\n\n(c) a transaction involving:\n\n(i) only persons who are all acting for the Crown in the\nsame right (and none of whom is an authority of the\nCommonwealth or an authority of a State or Territory);\nor\n\n(ii) only persons who are all acting for the same authority of\nthe Commonwealth; or\n\n(iii) only persons who are all acting for the same authority of\na State or Territory; or\n\n(iv) only the Crown in right of the Commonwealth and one\nor more non-commercial authorities of the\nCommonwealth; or\n\n(v) only the Crown in right of a State or Territory and one\nor more non-commercial authorities of that State or\nTerritory; or\n\n(vi) only non-commercial authorities of the Commonwealth;\nor\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary"
    },
