    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4f",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4F References to purpose or reason",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-4f"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.61",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act:\n\n(a) a provision of a contract, arrangement or understanding or of\na proposed contract, arrangement or understanding shall be\ndeemed to have had, or to have, a particular purpose if:\n\n(i) the provision was included in the contract, arrangement\nor understanding or is to be included in the proposed\ncontract, arrangement or understanding for that purpose\nor for purposes that included or include that purpose;\nand\n\n(ii) that purpose was or is a substantial purpose; and\n\n(b) a person shall be deemed to have engaged or to engage in\nconduct for a particular purpose or a particular reason if:\n\n(i) the person engaged or engages in the conduct for\npurposes that included or include that purpose or for\nreasons that included or include that reason, as the case\nmay be; and\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Act:\n\n(a) a provision of a contract, arrangement or understanding or of\na proposed contract, arrangement or understanding shall be\ndeemed to have had, or to have, a particular purpose if:\n\n(i) the provision was included in the contract, arrangement\nor understanding or is to be included in the proposed\ncontract, arrangement or understanding for that purpose\nor for purposes that included or include that purpose;\nand\n\n(ii) that purpose was or is a substantial purpose; and\n\n(b) a person shall be deemed to have engaged or to engage in\nconduct for a particular purpose or a particular reason if:\n\n(i) the person engaged or engages in the conduct for\npurposes that included or include that purpose or for\nreasons that included or include that reason, as the case\nmay be; and\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4f-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a4a775e40089faac4af9f1b13a3782d3312e7afd39c92984bb963354000cb0d7",
      "skos:note": "Deems a provision of a contract or arrangement to have had a particular purpose if included for that purpose."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-4f",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4F References to purpose or reason",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 61,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act:\n\n(a) a provision of a contract, arrangement or understanding or of\na proposed contract, arrangement or understanding shall be\ndeemed to have had, or to have, a particular purpose if:\n\n(i) the provision was included in the contract, arrangement\nor understanding or is to be included in the proposed\ncontract, arrangement or understanding for that purpose\nor for purposes that included or include that purpose;\nand\n\n(ii) that purpose was or is a substantial purpose; and\n\n(b) a person shall be deemed to have engaged or to engage in\nconduct for a particular purpose or a particular reason if:\n\n(i) the person engaged or engages in the conduct for\npurposes that included or include that purpose or for\nreasons that included or include that reason, as the case\nmay be; and\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary"
    },
