      "cml:premiseText": "For the purposes of this Act, references to the lessening of\ncompetition shall be read as including references to preventing or\nhindering competition.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Preventing or hindering competition is included in the lessening of competition."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4g-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Includes a temporal interval for the application of the prohibition.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "For the purposes of this Act, references to the lessening of\ncompetition shall be read as including references to preventing or\nhindering competition.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The prohibition on preventing or hindering competition applies at all times."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4g-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Includes a trace for the application of the prohibition.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "For the purposes of this Act, references to the lessening of\ncompetition shall be read as including references to preventing or\nhindering competition.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The prohibition on preventing or hindering competition applies at all times and is part of the trace."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4g-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Includes a descriptive clause defining 'preventing or hindering'.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "For the purposes of this Act, references to the lessening of\ncompetition shall be read as including references to preventing or\nhindering competition.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The description of 'preventing or hindering' includes actions that prevent or hinder competition."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4g-logic-diffusion-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Includes a diffusion for the application of the prohibition.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "For the purposes of this Act, references to the lessening of\ncompetition shall be read as including references to preventing or\nhindering competition.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The prohibition on preventing or hindering competition is part of the diffusion."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4h",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4H Application of Act in relation to leases and licences of land and",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-4h"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "buildings\n\nIn this Act:\n\n(a) a reference to a contract shall be construed as including a\nreference to a lease of, or a licence in respect of, land or a\nbuilding or part of a building and shall be so construed\nnotwithstanding the express references in this Act to such\nleases or licences;\n\n(b) a reference to making or entering into a contract, in relation\nto such a lease or licence, shall be read as a reference to\ngranting or taking the lease or licence; and\n\n(c) a reference to a party to a contract, in relation to such a lease\nor licence, shall be read as including a reference to any\nperson bound by, or entitled to the benefit of, any provision\ncontained in the lease or licence.",
      "skos:definition": "buildings\n\nIn this Act:\n\n(a) a reference to a contract shall be construed as including a\nreference to a lease of, or a licence in respect of, land or a\nbuilding or part of a building and shall be so construed\nnotwithstanding the express references in this Act to such\nleases or licences;\n\n(b) a reference to making or entering into a contract, in relation\nto such a lease or licence, shall be read as a reference to\ngranting or taking the lease or licence; and\n\n(c) a reference to a party to a contract, in relation to such a lease\nor licence, shall be read as including a reference to any\nperson bound by, or entitled to the benefit of, any provision\ncontained in the lease or licence.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4h-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4h-logic-alleninterval-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4h-logic-ltl-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4h-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a5b7e3582ca2e4e493597aadce0404c4bb85fbcaa86469edacff8df0c0bd6635",
      "skos:note": "References contracts, leases, and licences of land and buildings."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-4h",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4H Application of Act in relation to leases and licences of land and",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 62,
      "values:originalText": "buildings\n\nIn this Act:\n\n(a) a reference to a contract shall be construed as including a\nreference to a lease of, or a licence in respect of, land or a\nbuilding or part of a building and shall be so construed\nnotwithstanding the express references in this Act to such\nleases or licences;\n\n(b) a reference to making or entering into a contract, in relation\nto such a lease or licence, shall be read as a reference to\ngranting or taking the lease or licence; and\n\n(c) a reference to a party to a contract, in relation to such a lease\nor licence, shall be read as including a reference to any\nperson bound by, or entitled to the benefit of, any provision\ncontained in the lease or licence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4h-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-4h"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
