      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.81",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Governor-General may terminate the appointment of a\nmember of the Commission for misbehaviour or physical or mental\nincapacity.\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Governor-General may terminate the appointment of a\nmember of the Commission for misbehaviour or physical or mental\nincapacity.\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
