      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 84,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to this section, the Chairperson shall convene such\nmeetings of the Commission as he or she thinks necessary for the\nefficient performance of the functions of the Commission."
    },
