    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "18(4) Meetings of Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-18-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.84",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In the absence of the Chairperson from a meeting of the\nCommission:\n\n(a) if there are 2 Deputy Chairpersons available to preside at the\nmeeting—the Chairperson may nominate 1 of them to\npreside at the meeting; or\n\n(b) if there is only 1 Deputy Chairperson available to preside at\nthe meeting—that Deputy Chairperson is to preside at the\nmeeting.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In the absence of the Chairperson from a meeting of the\nCommission:\n\n(a) if there are 2 Deputy Chairpersons available to preside at the\nmeeting—the Chairperson may nominate 1 of them to\npreside at the meeting; or\n\n(b) if there is only 1 Deputy Chairperson available to preside at\nthe meeting—that Deputy Chairperson is to preside at the\nmeeting.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c100b831d49166714b69f8339ab1a2ec91762df4a758e6f3934bdf426711fee0",
      "skos:note": "Duty to nominate Deputy Chairperson in absence of Chairperson"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-18-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "18(4) Meetings of Commission",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 84,
      "values:originalText": "(4) In the absence of the Chairperson from a meeting of the\nCommission:\n\n(a) if there are 2 Deputy Chairpersons available to preside at the\nmeeting—the Chairperson may nominate 1 of them to\npreside at the meeting; or\n\n(b) if there is only 1 Deputy Chairperson available to preside at\nthe meeting—that Deputy Chairperson is to preside at the\nmeeting."
    },
    {
