    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "18(6) Meetings of Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-18-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.84",
      "values:originalText": "(6) At a meeting of the Commission:\n\nPreliminary  Chapter 1\nThe Australian Competition and Consumer Commission  Part II\n\nSection 19\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) three members (including the Chairperson or a Deputy\nChairperson) form a quorum;\n\n(b) all questions shall be decided by a majority of votes of the\nmembers present and voting; and\n\n(c) the member presiding has a deliberative vote and, in the\nevent of an equality of votes, also has a casting vote.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) At a meeting of the Commission:\n\nPreliminary  Chapter 1\nThe Australian Competition and Consumer Commission  Part II\n\nSection 19\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) three members (including the Chairperson or a Deputy\nChairperson) form a quorum;\n\n(b) all questions shall be decided by a majority of votes of the\nmembers present and voting; and\n\n(c) the member presiding has a deliberative vote and, in the\nevent of an equality of votes, also has a casting vote.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-6-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-6-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f30b570a069465b68f760a8bc6dc1db70e3ce26330bfc1577cf7dff467dcc80c",
      "skos:note": "Quorum requirements for Commission meetings"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-18-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "18(6) Meetings of Commission",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 84,
      "values:originalText": "(6) At a meeting of the Commission:\n\nPreliminary  Chapter 1\nThe Australian Competition and Consumer Commission  Part II\n\nSection 19\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) three members (including the Chairperson or a Deputy\nChairperson) form a quorum;\n\n(b) all questions shall be decided by a majority of votes of the\nmembers present and voting; and\n\n(c) the member presiding has a deliberative vote and, in the\nevent of an equality of votes, also has a casting vote."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-6"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-6-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "has",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Member presiding has a deliberative vote and casting vote",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) three members (including the Chairperson or a Deputy Chairperson) form a quorum;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(c) the member presiding has a deliberative vote and, in the event of an equality of votes, also has a casting vote."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-6-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "has",
      "cml:logicSummary": "All questions shall be decided by a majority of votes of the members present and voting",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) all questions shall be decided by a majority of votes of the members present and voting;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-6-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "has",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Three members form a quorum",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) three members (including the Chairperson or a Deputy Chairperson) form a quorum;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "18(7) Meetings of Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-18-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.84",
      "values:originalText": "(7) If the Commission so determines, a member or members may\nparticipate in, and form part of a quorum at, a meeting of the\nCommission or a Division of the Commission by means of any of\nthe following methods of communication:\n\n(a) telephone;\n\n(b) closed circuit television;\n\n(c) another method of communication determined by the\nCommission.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) If the Commission so determines, a member or members may\nparticipate in, and form part of a quorum at, a meeting of the\nCommission or a Division of the Commission by means of any of\nthe following methods of communication:\n\n(a) telephone;\n\n(b) closed circuit television;\n\n(c) another method of communication determined by the\nCommission.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-7-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "74231d4ae799931f521b0ccce286e3a353109358f88704375e94063c98635c01",
      "skos:note": "Methods of communication for Commission meetings"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-18-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "18(7) Meetings of Commission",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 84,
      "values:originalText": "(7) If the Commission so determines, a member or members may\nparticipate in, and form part of a quorum at, a meeting of the\nCommission or a Division of the Commission by means of any of\nthe following methods of communication:\n\n(a) telephone;\n\n(b) closed circuit television;\n\n(c) another method of communication determined by the\nCommission."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-18-ss-7-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
