    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-27-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "27 Staff of Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-27-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.88",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The staff necessary to assist the Commission shall be persons\nengaged under the Public Service Act 1999.\n\nPreliminary  Chapter 1\nThe Australian Competition and Consumer Commission  Part II\n\nSection 27A\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:\n\n(a) the Chairperson of the Commission and the APS employees\nassisting the Chairperson together constitute a Statutory\nAgency; and\n\n(b) the Chairperson is the Head of that Statutory Agency.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The staff necessary to assist the Commission shall be persons\nengaged under the Public Service Act 1999.\n\nPreliminary  Chapter 1\nThe Australian Competition and Consumer Commission  Part II\n\nSection 27A\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:\n\n(a) the Chairperson of the Commission and the APS employees\nassisting the Chairperson together constitute a Statutory\nAgency; and\n\n(b) the Chairperson is the Head of that Statutory Agency.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-27-2-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-27-2-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0da0c3202795161340aec22b7bdb743bfaa176ec14d42f5fd556a48ac4d62914"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-27-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "27 Staff of Commission",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 88,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The staff necessary to assist the Commission shall be persons\nengaged under the Public Service Act 1999.\n\nPreliminary  Chapter 1\nThe Australian Competition and Consumer Commission  Part II\n\nSection 27A\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:\n\n(a) the Chairperson of the Commission and the APS employees\nassisting the Chairperson together constitute a Statutory\nAgency; and\n\n(b) the Chairperson is the Head of that Statutory Agency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-27-2-ss-1",
