      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.88",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:\n\n(a) the Chairperson of the Commission and the APS employees\nassisting the Chairperson together constitute a Statutory\nAgency; and\n\n(b) the Chairperson is the Head of that Statutory Agency.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:\n\n(a) the Chairperson of the Commission and the APS employees\nassisting the Chairperson together constitute a Statutory\nAgency; and\n\n(b) the Chairperson is the Head of that Statutory Agency.",
      "values:partOf": {
