      "skos:definition": "(3) If either House of the Parliament or a Committee of either House,\nor of both Houses, of the Parliament requires the Commission to\nfurnish to that House or Committee any information concerning the\nperformance of the functions of the Commission under this Act,\nthe Commission shall comply with the requirement.\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "89b5b8b38aeb4fb20f2e46e5d98ee1d403c66f5dd2fc7c4fd39ab6e2f9a3fd57",
      "skos:note": "Commission must comply with requirements from Parliament or its committees."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-29-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29(3) Commission to comply with directions of Minister and",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 91,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If either House of the Parliament or a Committee of either House,\nor of both Houses, of the Parliament requires the Commission to\nfurnish to that House or Committee any information concerning the\nperformance of the functions of the Commission under this Act,\nthe Commission shall comply with the requirement.\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary"
    },
