    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "29A Establishment of Council",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-29a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.92",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The National Competition Council is established by this section.\n\n(2) For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013):\n\n(a) the Council is a listed entity; and\n\n(b) the Council President is the accountable authority of the\nCouncil; and\n\n(c) the following persons are officials of the Council:\n\n(i) the Council President;\n\n(ii) the other Councillors;\n\n(iii) the staff referred to in subsection 29M(1);\n\n(iv) consultants engaged under section 29N; and\n\n(d) the purposes of the Council include the functions of the\nCouncil referred to in section 29B.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The National Competition Council is established by this section.\n\n(2) For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013):\n\n(a) the Council is a listed entity; and\n\n(b) the Council President is the accountable authority of the\nCouncil; and\n\n(c) the following persons are officials of the Council:\n\n(i) the Council President;\n\n(ii) the other Councillors;\n\n(iii) the staff referred to in subsection 29M(1);\n\n(iv) consultants engaged under section 29N; and\n\n(d) the purposes of the Council include the functions of the\nCouncil referred to in section 29B.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
