      "values:originalText": "(1) The Council’s functions include:\n\n(a) carrying out research into matters referred to the Council by\nthe Minister; and\n\n(b) providing advice on matters referred to the Council by the\nMinister.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Council’s functions include:\n\n(a) carrying out research into matters referred to the Council by\nthe Minister; and\n\n(b) providing advice on matters referred to the Council by the\nMinister.",
      "values:partOf": {
