      "values:originalText": "(3) The Council cannot perform a duty or function, or exercise a\npower, under a State/Territory energy law unless the conferral of\nthe function or power, or the imposition of the duty, is in\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Council cannot perform a duty or function, or exercise a\npower, under a State/Territory energy law unless the conferral of\nthe function or power, or the imposition of the duty, is in\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
