    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29bb-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "29BB(3) How duty is imposed",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-29bb-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.94",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, to ensure the validity of the purported imposition of the duty, it\nis necessary that the duty be imposed by a law of the\nCommonwealth (rather than by the law of the State or Territory),\nthe duty is taken to be imposed by this Part to the extent necessary\nto ensure that validity.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If, to ensure the validity of the purported imposition of the duty, it\nis necessary that the duty be imposed by a law of the\nCommonwealth (rather than by the law of the State or Territory),\nthe duty is taken to be imposed by this Part to the extent necessary\nto ensure that validity.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29bb"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29bb-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29bb-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8324be5b51fdcc596e42487a4b1d83397f4c87d8a1db7155b53fe8884e4f530a",
      "skos:note": "Duty imposed by law of the Commonwealth if necessary for validity"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-29bb-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29BB(3) How duty is imposed",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 94,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, to ensure the validity of the purported imposition of the duty, it\nis necessary that the duty be imposed by a law of the\nCommonwealth (rather than by the law of the State or Territory),\nthe duty is taken to be imposed by this Part to the extent necessary\nto ensure that validity."
    },
