    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29l-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "29L(7) Council meetings",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-29l-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.98",
      "values:originalText": "(7) At a meeting, a question must be decided by a majority of votes of\nthe Councillors present and voting. The Councillor presiding has a\ndeliberative vote, and a casting vote if the deliberative votes are\nequally divided.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) At a meeting, a question must be decided by a majority of votes of\nthe Councillors present and voting. The Councillor presiding has a\ndeliberative vote, and a casting vote if the deliberative votes are\nequally divided.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29l"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29l-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-29l-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "22cd357ac5d23d4af6349064d2ef03731516d3f18b1718518efc50cf9b3417fd",
      "skos:note": "Decision by majority of votes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-29l-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29L(7) Council meetings",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 98,
      "values:originalText": "(7) At a meeting, a question must be decided by a majority of votes of\nthe Councillors present and voting. The Councillor presiding has a\ndeliberative vote, and a casting vote if the deliberative votes are\nequally divided."
    },
