      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.99",
      "values:originalText": "An annual report prepared by the Council President and given to\nthe Minister under section 46 of the Public Governance,\nPerformance and Accountability Act 2013 for a period must\ninclude details of the following:\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
      "skos:definition": "An annual report prepared by the Council President and given to\nthe Minister under section 46 of the Public Governance,\nPerformance and Accountability Act 2013 for a period must\ninclude details of the following:\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
