      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 101,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A person shall not be appointed as a member of the Tribunal other\nthan a presidential member unless he or she appears to the\nGovernor-General to be qualified for appointment by virtue of his\nor her knowledge of, or experience in, industry, commerce,\neconomics, law or public administration."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must be qualified",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Person shall not be appointed unless...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Person must be qualified"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "BETWEEN",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Knowledge or experience is a temporal interval",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "...by virtue of his or her knowledge...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Person must be qualified by virtue of knowledge or experience"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31-ss-2-logic-argumentation-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "IMPLIES",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Appointment implies qualification",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A person shall not be appointed unless...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Appointment implies qualification"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "31A Appointment of Judge as presidential member of Tribunal not",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-31a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "to affect tenure etc.\n\nThe appointment of a Judge of a Federal Court as a presidential\nmember of the Tribunal, or service by a Judge of a Federal Court\nas a presidential member of the Tribunal, whether the appointment\nwas or is made or the service occurred or occurs before or after the\ncommencement of this section, does not affect, and shall be\ndeemed never to have affected, his or her tenure of office as a\nJudge of a Federal Court or his or her rank, title, status,\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
      "skos:definition": "to affect tenure etc.\n\nThe appointment of a Judge of a Federal Court as a presidential\nmember of the Tribunal, or service by a Judge of a Federal Court\nas a presidential member of the Tribunal, whether the appointment\nwas or is made or the service occurred or occurs before or after the\ncommencement of this section, does not affect, and shall be\ndeemed never to have affected, his or her tenure of office as a\nJudge of a Federal Court or his or her rank, title, status,\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8c59d8601af68c64c547435e1b73f28e9d64ea382f987d84c1f2573b29b45dc7",
      "skos:note": "Appointment of Judge as presidential member of Tribunal does not affect tenure."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-31a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "31A Appointment of Judge as presidential member of Tribunal not",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 101,
      "values:originalText": "to affect tenure etc.\n\nThe appointment of a Judge of a Federal Court as a presidential\nmember of the Tribunal, or service by a Judge of a Federal Court\nas a presidential member of the Tribunal, whether the appointment\nwas or is made or the service occurred or occurs before or after the\ncommencement of this section, does not affect, and shall be\ndeemed never to have affected, his or her tenure of office as a\nJudge of a Federal Court or his or her rank, title, status,\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-31a"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
