      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.104",
      "values:originalText": "(7) A presidential member of the Tribunal ceases to hold office if he or\nshe no longer holds office as a Judge of a Federal Court, not being\nthe High Court or a court of an external Territory.",
