      "values:originalText": "(3) Where this section applies in relation to proceedings that were\nbeing dealt with before the Tribunal, the President may, instead of\ngiving a direction under subsection (2), direct that the hearing and\ndetermination, or the determination, of the proceedings be\ncompleted by the Tribunal constituted by the members other than\nthe member referred to in subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Where this section applies in relation to proceedings that were\nbeing dealt with before the Tribunal, the President may, instead of\ngiving a direction under subsection (2), direct that the hearing and\ndetermination, or the determination, of the proceedings be\ncompleted by the Tribunal constituted by the members other than\nthe member referred to in subsection (1).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-43"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-43-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a8231ba35232b219f27e9214768a4b310e84893dae64f2189e526bb26b815c71",
      "skos:note": "Conditional commencement of proceedings"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-43-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "43(3) Member of Tribunal ceasing to be available",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 107,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Where this section applies in relation to proceedings that were\nbeing dealt with before the Tribunal, the President may, instead of\ngiving a direction under subsection (2), direct that the hearing and\ndetermination, or the determination, of the proceedings be\ncompleted by the Tribunal constituted by the members other than\nthe member referred to in subsection (1)."
    },
