      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.107",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Where the President has given a direction under subsection (3), he\nor she may, at any time before the determination of the\nproceedings, direct that a third member be added to the Tribunal as\nconstituted in accordance with subsection (3).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Where the President has given a direction under subsection (3), he\nor she may, at any time before the determination of the\nproceedings, direct that a third member be added to the Tribunal as\nconstituted in accordance with subsection (3).",
