      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.108",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Registrar and the Deputy Registrars, and the staff necessary to\nassist them, shall be persons engaged under the Public Service Act\n1999.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Registrar and the Deputy Registrars, and the staff necessary to\nassist them, shall be persons engaged under the Public Service Act\n1999.",
