        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44a-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "may",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The Minister has the power to appoint.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ab",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44AB Definitions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ab"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.109",
      "values:originalText": "In this Part, unless the contrary intention appears:\nAustralian Energy Market Agreement means the agreement, as\namended from time to time:\n\n(a) that relates to energy; and\n\n(b) that is between the Commonwealth, all of the States, the\nAustralian Capital Territory and the Northern Territory; and\n\n(c) that is first made in 2004; and\n\n(d) that agrees to the establishment of the AER and the AEMC.\nfull-time AER member means an AER member appointed on a\nfull-time basis.\npart-time AER member means an AER member appointed on a\npart-time basis.\n44AC  This Part binds the Crown\n\nThis Part binds the Crown in each of its capacities.",
      "skos:definition": "In this Part, unless the contrary intention appears:\nAustralian Energy Market Agreement means the agreement, as\namended from time to time:\n\n(a) that relates to energy; and\n\n(b) that is between the Commonwealth, all of the States, the\nAustralian Capital Territory and the Northern Territory; and\n\n(c) that is first made in 2004; and\n\n(d) that agrees to the establishment of the AER and the AEMC.\nfull-time AER member means an AER member appointed on a\nfull-time basis.\npart-time AER member means an AER member appointed on a\npart-time basis.\n44AC  This Part binds the Crown\n\nThis Part binds the Crown in each of its capacities.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ab-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ab-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ab-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c1b1d0d3317f29aaf898694dd73d65ef0c762f21996a2c062806591ee95f8bae",
      "skos:note": "Defines terms for Australian Energy Market Agreement and its members."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ab",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44AB Definitions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 109,
      "values:originalText": "In this Part, unless the contrary intention appears:\nAustralian Energy Market Agreement means the agreement, as\namended from time to time:\n\n(a) that relates to energy; and\n\n(b) that is between the Commonwealth, all of the States, the\nAustralian Capital Territory and the Northern Territory; and\n\n(c) that is first made in 2004; and\n\n(d) that agrees to the establishment of the AER and the AEMC.\nfull-time AER member means an AER member appointed on a\nfull-time basis.\npart-time AER member means an AER member appointed on a\npart-time basis.\n44AC  This Part binds the Crown\n\nThis Part binds the Crown in each of its capacities."
    },
