      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.111",
      "values:originalText": "Commonwealth\n\nThe AER holds any money or property for and on behalf of the\nCommonwealth.",
      "skos:definition": "Commonwealth\n\nThe AER holds any money or property for and on behalf of the\nCommonwealth.",
