      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.112",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to section 44AIA, a State/Territory energy law or a local\nenergy instrument may confer functions or powers, or impose\nduties, on the AER for the purposes of that law or instrument.\nNote:\nSection 44AK sets out when such a law or instrument imposes a duty\non the AER.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to section 44AIA, a State/Territory energy law or a local\nenergy instrument may confer functions or powers, or impose\nduties, on the AER for the purposes of that law or instrument.\nNote:\nSection 44AK sets out when such a law or instrument imposes a duty\non the AER.",
      "values:partOf": {
