      "skos:note": "A State/Territory energy law may confer functions or powers on the AER."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ai-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44AI(1) Commonwealth consent to conferral of functions etc. on AER",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 112,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to section 44AIA, a State/Territory energy law or a local\nenergy instrument may confer functions or powers, or impose\nduties, on the AER for the purposes of that law or instrument.\nNote:\nSection 44AK sets out when such a law or instrument imposes a duty\non the AER."
