      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) A local energy instrument may confer functions or powers, or impose duties, on the AER only if...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the instrument is designated for the purposes of this subsection under the Australian Energy Market Agreement, or any other relevant agreement..."
