        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ai-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ai-ss-5-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ai-ss-5-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ai-ss-5-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f7669497ad299fce8b64fac8fac6182651bf2126c0fd9c82ec56a3176f2e35c3",
      "skos:note": "No merits review of AER decisions under State/Territory energy laws or local energy instruments."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ai-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44AI(5) Commonwealth consent to conferral of functions etc. on AER",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 112,
      "values:originalText": "(5) To avoid doubt, if a State/Territory energy law is also a local\nenergy instrument, subsection (4) applies to the law.\n44AIA  No merits review of AER decisions\n\nA decision of the AER under a State/Territory energy law or local\nenergy instrument is not to be subject to merits review (however\ndescribed) by a body established under a law of a State or\nTerritory."
    },
