      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44AS(2) Acting AER Deputy Chair",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 119,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If a person acting as the AER Deputy Chair ceases to be an AER\nmember, then the appointment to act as the AER Deputy Chair also\nceases.\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary\nPart IIIAA  The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)"
    },
