    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44at",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44AT Remuneration of AER members",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44at"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.120",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An AER member is to be paid the remuneration that is determined\nby the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that\nremuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the member is to be\npaid the remuneration that is prescribed.\n\n(2) An AER member is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed.\n\n(3) Subsections (1) and (2) have effect subject to the Remuneration\nTribunal Act 1973.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An AER member is to be paid the remuneration that is determined\nby the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that\nremuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the member is to be\npaid the remuneration that is prescribed.\n\n(2) An AER member is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed.\n\n(3) Subsections (1) and (2) have effect subject to the Remuneration\nTribunal Act 1973.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44at-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44at-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44at-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4a1204efed2740119c34bb963a85972de01352fbd3c9b40b945e9222f8ae45c9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44at",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44AT Remuneration of AER members",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 120,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An AER member is to be paid the remuneration that is determined\nby the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that\nremuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the member is to be\npaid the remuneration that is prescribed.\n\n(2) An AER member is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed.\n\n(3) Subsections (1) and (2) have effect subject to the Remuneration\nTribunal Act 1973."
    },
