      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.120",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The AER Chair is to be paid additional remuneration (if any)\ndetermined by the Remuneration Tribunal.\n\n(2) The AER Chair is to be paid additional allowances (if any) that are\nprescribed.\n\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973 other than subsection 7(11) of that Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The AER Chair is to be paid additional remuneration (if any)\ndetermined by the Remuneration Tribunal.\n\n(2) The AER Chair is to be paid additional allowances (if any) that are\nprescribed.\n\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973 other than subsection 7(11) of that Act.",
