      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A person who is the AER Deputy Chair may resign the person’s\nappointment as AER Deputy Chair by giving the\nGovernor-General a written resignation. The resignation does not\naffect the person’s appointment as an AER member.\n44AAB  Termination of appointment\nAll AER members",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A person who is the AER Deputy Chair may resign the person’s\nappointment as AER Deputy Chair by giving the\nGovernor-General a written resignation. The resignation does not\naffect the person’s appointment as an AER member.\n44AAB  Termination of appointment\nAll AER members",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44az"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44az-ss-3-norm"
        },
