      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "(3) At a meeting of the AER, 3 AER members constitute a quorum.\nThe quorum must include the AER Chair.\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary\nPart IIIAA  The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)",
      "skos:definition": "(3) At a meeting of the AER, 3 AER members constitute a quorum.\nThe quorum must include the AER Chair.\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary\nPart IIIAA  The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44az"
      },
