      "cml:integrityHash": "ca89e03bdbf5bbbbf8cb7b05163c1bb542abb50d7aed27888b2a8342aafcc262",
      "skos:note": "Quorum requirement for AER meetings Termination of appointment for absence or conflict of interest Resignation obligation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44az-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44AZ(3) Resignation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 122,
      "values:originalText": "(3) At a meeting of the AER, 3 AER members constitute a quorum.\nThe quorum must include the AER Chair.\n\nChapter 1  Preliminary\nPart IIIAA  The Australian Energy Regulator (AER)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44az-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44az-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44az-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "requires",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Requires a quorum of 3 members",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "At least 3 AER members must be present",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The meeting is invalid if less than 3 members are present"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44az-ss-3-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "requires",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Requires the AER Chair to be present",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "At least one member must be present",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The meeting is invalid if less than one member is present"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44az-ss-3-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "requires",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Requires a quorum of at least 3 members",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "At least 2 members must be present",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The meeting is invalid if less than 2 members are present"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44az-ss-3-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition on termination without cause",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) The Governor-General may terminate the appointment of a part-time AER member if:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44az-ss-3-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition on paid employment that conflicts with duties",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) the member engages in paid employment that conflicts or could conflict with the proper performance of the duties of his or her office."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44az-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlap",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Overlap between absence and duty period",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the member is absent, except on leave of absence, from 3 consecutive meetings of the AER;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44az-ss-3-logic-deontic-7",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "OBLIGES",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Governor-General is obligated to receive resignation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "AER Deputy Chair appointment",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Resignation received"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44aa",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44AA Objects of Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44aa"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.139",
      "values:originalText": "The objects of this Part are to:\n\n(a) promote the economically efficient operation of, use of and\ninvestment in the infrastructure by which services are\nprovided, thereby promoting effective competition in\nupstream and downstream markets; and\n\n(b) provide a framework and guiding principles to encourage a\nconsistent approach to access regulation in each industry.",
      "skos:definition": "The objects of this Part are to:\n\n(a) promote the economically efficient operation of, use of and\ninvestment in the infrastructure by which services are\nprovided, thereby promoting effective competition in\nupstream and downstream markets; and\n\n(b) provide a framework and guiding principles to encourage a\nconsistent approach to access regulation in each industry.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44aa-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44aa-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a7db8b484ccd21c319fefea8060b54c738d3e069c1eb48a3a689ed5acd331e08",
      "skos:note": "Promote economically efficient infrastructure operation and investment."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44aa",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44AA Objects of Part",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 139,
      "values:originalText": "The objects of this Part are to:\n\n(a) promote the economically efficient operation of, use of and\ninvestment in the infrastructure by which services are\nprovided, thereby promoting effective competition in\nupstream and downstream markets; and\n\n(b) provide a framework and guiding principles to encourage a\nconsistent approach to access regulation in each industry."
    },
    {
