    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44f-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44F(2) Person may request recommendation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44f-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.148",
      "values:originalText": "(2) After receiving an application under subsection (1), the Council:\n\n(a) must tell the provider of the service that the Council has\nreceived the application, unless the provider is the applicant;\nand\n\n(b) must, after having regard to the objects of this Part,\nrecommend to the designated Minister:\n\n(i) that the service be declared, with the expiry date\nspecified in the recommendation; or\n\n(ii) that the service not be declared.\nNote 1:\nThere are time limits that apply to the Council’s recommendation: see\nsection 44GA.\nNote 2:\nThe Council may request information and invite public submissions\non the application: see sections 44FA and 44GB.\nNote 3:\nThe Council must publish its recommendation: see section 44GC.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) After receiving an application under subsection (1), the Council:\n\n(a) must tell the provider of the service that the Council has\nreceived the application, unless the provider is the applicant;\nand\n\n(b) must, after having regard to the objects of this Part,\nrecommend to the designated Minister:\n\n(i) that the service be declared, with the expiry date\nspecified in the recommendation; or\n\n(ii) that the service not be declared.\nNote 1:\nThere are time limits that apply to the Council’s recommendation: see\nsection 44GA.\nNote 2:\nThe Council may request information and invite public submissions\non the application: see sections 44FA and 44GB.\nNote 3:\nThe Council must publish its recommendation: see section 44GC.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44f"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44f-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44f-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e80840c3673c151a9f8a3953464dae3f9bfb5ee5d8f363ec0fa03e3f8224c27c",
      "skos:note": "The Council must tell the provider of the service that it has received an application.",
      "dc:description": "Information about the application"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44f-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44F(2) Person may request recommendation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 148,
      "values:originalText": "(2) After receiving an application under subsection (1), the Council:\n\n(a) must tell the provider of the service that the Council has\nreceived the application, unless the provider is the applicant;\nand\n\n(b) must, after having regard to the objects of this Part,\nrecommend to the designated Minister:\n\n(i) that the service be declared, with the expiry date\nspecified in the recommendation; or\n\n(ii) that the service not be declared.\nNote 1:\nThere are time limits that apply to the Council’s recommendation: see\nsection 44GA.\nNote 2:\nThe Council may request information and invite public submissions\non the application: see sections 44FA and 44GB.\nNote 3:\nThe Council must publish its recommendation: see section 44GC."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44f-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44f-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
