      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 148,
      "values:originalText": "(7) If a request is made under subsection (6), the Council must decide\nto:\n\n(a) make the variation; or\n\n(b) reject the variation.\n\nChapter 2  Access to services"
