      "cof:title": "44H(4) Designated Minister may declare a service",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 156,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The designated Minister cannot declare a service unless he or she\nis satisfied of all of the declaration criteria for the service."
    },
