      "values:originalText": "(3) Before publishing under subsection (1), the designated Minister\nmay give any one or more of the following persons:\n\n(a) the applicant under section 44F;\n\n(b) if the applicant is not the provider of the service—the\nprovider;\n\n(c) any other person the designated Minister considers\nappropriate;\na notice in writing:\n\n(d) specifying what the designated Minister is proposing to\npublish; and\n\n(e) inviting the person to make a written submission to the\ndesignated Minister within 14 days after the notice is given\nidentifying any information the person considers should not\nbe published because of its confidential commercial nature.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Before publishing under subsection (1), the designated Minister\nmay give any one or more of the following persons:\n\n(a) the applicant under section 44F;\n\n(b) if the applicant is not the provider of the service—the\nprovider;\n\n(c) any other person the designated Minister considers\nappropriate;\na notice in writing:\n\n(d) specifying what the designated Minister is proposing to\npublish; and\n\n(e) inviting the person to make a written submission to the\ndesignated Minister within 14 days after the notice is given\nidentifying any information the person considers should not\nbe published because of its confidential commercial nature.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ha"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ha-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ha-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "634a64ff649626d0c54a910124ae9ba877dec684b070646eb48bb2d32db35a5a",
      "skos:note": "Designated Minister may give notice to persons before publishing decision."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ha-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44HA(3) Designated Minister must publish his or her decision",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 156,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Before publishing under subsection (1), the designated Minister\nmay give any one or more of the following persons:\n\n(a) the applicant under section 44F;\n\n(b) if the applicant is not the provider of the service—the\nprovider;\n\n(c) any other person the designated Minister considers\nappropriate;\na notice in writing:\n\n(d) specifying what the designated Minister is proposing to\npublish; and\n\n(e) inviting the person to make a written submission to the\ndesignated Minister within 14 days after the notice is given\nidentifying any information the person considers should not\nbe published because of its confidential commercial nature."
    },
