    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44i",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44I Duration and effect of declaration",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44i"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.157",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to this section, a declaration begins to operate at a time\nspecified in the declaration. The time cannot be earlier than 21\ndays after the declaration is published.\n\n(2) If:\n\n(a) an application for review of a declaration is made within 21\ndays after the day the declaration is published; and\n\n(b) the Tribunal makes an order under section 44KA staying the\noperation of the declaration;\nthe declaration does not begin to operate until the order is no\nlonger of effect under subsection 44KA(6) or the Tribunal makes a\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to this section, a declaration begins to operate at a time\nspecified in the declaration. The time cannot be earlier than 21\ndays after the declaration is published.\n\n(2) If:\n\n(a) an application for review of a declaration is made within 21\ndays after the day the declaration is published; and\n\n(b) the Tribunal makes an order under section 44KA staying the\noperation of the declaration;\nthe declaration does not begin to operate until the order is no\nlonger of effect under subsection 44KA(6) or the Tribunal makes a\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44i-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44i-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dea109bff1fc38476714ad7adec3d23bff83e6728f615f12bea87ae8cb5be469"
    },
    {
