      "values:originalText": "(5) If the designated Minister decides not to revoke, the designated\nMinister must give reasons for the decision to the provider of the\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nDeclared services  Division 2\n\nSection 44K\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\ndeclared service when the designated Minister publishes the\ndecision.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If the designated Minister decides not to revoke, the designated\nMinister must give reasons for the decision to the provider of the\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nDeclared services  Division 2\n\nSection 44K\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\ndeclared service when the designated Minister publishes the\ndecision.",
