    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44k-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44K(4) Review of declaration",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44k-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.159",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The review by the Tribunal is a re-consideration of the matter\nbased on the information, reports and things referred to in\nsection 44ZZOAA.\nNote:\nThere are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have\nregard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the\nTribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The review by the Tribunal is a re-consideration of the matter\nbased on the information, reports and things referred to in\nsection 44ZZOAA.\nNote:\nThere are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have\nregard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the\nTribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44k"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44k-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cf56581e5765bf558354c6935726fc1259af7f310377eca7da804b48d269cff0",
      "skos:note": "Reconsideration of the matter based on specified information and reports."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44k-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44K(4) Review of declaration",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 159,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The review by the Tribunal is a re-consideration of the matter\nbased on the information, reports and things referred to in\nsection 44ZZOAA.\nNote:\nThere are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have\nregard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the\nTribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA)."
    },
