      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.160",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subsection (3) does not prohibit the Tribunal from making an order\nwithout giving to a person referred to in that subsection a\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Subsection (3) does not prohibit the Tribunal from making an order\nwithout giving to a person referred to in that subsection a\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "values:partOf": {
