      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.162",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If a party (the first party) is ordered to pay some or all of the costs\nof another party under subsection (1), the amount of the costs may\nbe recovered in the Federal Court as a debt due by the first party to\nthe other party.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If a party (the first party) is ordered to pay some or all of the costs\nof another party under subsection (1), the amount of the costs may\nbe recovered in the Federal Court as a debt due by the first party to\nthe other party.",
