    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44lb-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44LB(2) Ineligibility recommendation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44lb-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.165",
      "values:originalText": "(2) After receiving the application, the Council must, after having\nregard to the objects of this Part:\n\n(a) recommend to the designated Minister:\n\n(i) that he or she decide that the service is ineligible to be a\ndeclared service; and\n\n(ii) the period for which the decision should be in force\n(which must be at least 20 years); or\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "skos:definition": "(2) After receiving the application, the Council must, after having\nregard to the objects of this Part:\n\n(a) recommend to the designated Minister:\n\n(i) that he or she decide that the service is ineligible to be a\ndeclared service; and\n\n(ii) the period for which the decision should be in force\n(which must be at least 20 years); or\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "values:partOf": {
