    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44LD(7) Time limit for Council recommendations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ld-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.168",
      "values:originalText": "(7) If the Council is unable to make a recommendation within the\nconsideration period (whether it is the expected period or it has\nbeen previously extended under this subsection), it must, by notice\nin writing to the designated Minister, extend the consideration\nperiod by a specified period.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) If the Council is unable to make a recommendation within the\nconsideration period (whether it is the expected period or it has\nbeen previously extended under this subsection), it must, by notice\nin writing to the designated Minister, extend the consideration\nperiod by a specified period.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4fc132bcc6896a19f602307123faae87fcefd9c8ec8a7d8cc70f4e2366315dae",
      "skos:note": "Council must extend consideration period by notice if unable to make recommendation within time limit."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ld-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44LD(7) Time limit for Council recommendations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 168,
      "values:originalText": "(7) If the Council is unable to make a recommendation within the\nconsideration period (whether it is the expected period or it has\nbeen previously extended under this subsection), it must, by notice\nin writing to the designated Minister, extend the consideration\nperiod by a specified period."
    },
