    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44LD(8) Time limit for Council recommendations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ld-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.168",
      "values:originalText": "(8) The notice must:\n\n(a) specify when the Council must now make a recommendation\non the application; and\n\n(b) include a statement explaining why the Council has been\nunable to make a decision on the recommendation within the\nconsideration period.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) The notice must:\n\n(a) specify when the Council must now make a recommendation\non the application; and\n\n(b) include a statement explaining why the Council has been\nunable to make a decision on the recommendation within the\nconsideration period.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
