      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.168",
      "values:originalText": "(9) The Council must give a copy of the notice to:\n\n(a) the applicant; and\n\n(b) if the applicant is not the person who is, or expects to be, the\nprovider—that person.\nPublication",
      "skos:definition": "(9) The Council must give a copy of the notice to:\n\n(a) the applicant; and\n\n(b) if the applicant is not the person who is, or expects to be, the\nprovider—that person.\nPublication",
      "values:partOf": {
