    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld-ss-10",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44LD(10) Time limit for Council recommendations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ld-ss-10"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.168",
      "values:originalText": "(10) If the Council extends the consideration period under\nsubsection (7), it must publish a notice in a manner that results in\nthe notice being accessible to the public and reasonably prominent:\n\n(a) stating that it has done so; and\n\n(b) specifying the day by which it must now make a\nrecommendation on the application.\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "skos:definition": "(10) If the Council extends the consideration period under\nsubsection (7), it must publish a notice in a manner that results in\nthe notice being accessible to the public and reasonably prominent:\n\n(a) stating that it has done so; and\n\n(b) specifying the day by which it must now make a\nrecommendation on the application.\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld-ss-10-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld-ss-10-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "764147cbea646c8f05544889264e949461b5a7e25dfb907eac372f2f01d3d611",
      "skos:note": "Publish a notice stating the extension and new deadline for recommendation.",
      "dc:description": "Notice to the public"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ld-ss-10",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44LD(10) Time limit for Council recommendations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 168,
      "values:originalText": "(10) If the Council extends the consideration period under\nsubsection (7), it must publish a notice in a manner that results in\nthe notice being accessible to the public and reasonably prominent:\n\n(a) stating that it has done so; and\n\n(b) specifying the day by which it must now make a\nrecommendation on the application.\n\nChapter 2  Access to services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld-ss-10-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ld-ss-10"
