    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44le-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44LE(5) Council may invite public submissions on the application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44le-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.170",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A person may, at the time of making a submission, request that the\nCouncil:\n\n(a) not make the whole or a part of the submission available\nunder subsection (4); and\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nServices that are ineligible to be declared  Division 2AA\n\nSection 44LF\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) not publish or make available the whole or a part of the\nsubmission under section 44LF;\nbecause of the confidential commercial information contained in\nthe submission.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A person may, at the time of making a submission, request that the\nCouncil:\n\n(a) not make the whole or a part of the submission available\nunder subsection (4); and\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nServices that are ineligible to be declared  Division 2AA\n\nSection 44LF\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) not publish or make available the whole or a part of the\nsubmission under section 44LF;\nbecause of the confidential commercial information contained in\nthe submission.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44le"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44le-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44le-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a17608a3064ae6159753a5bd0b07b13be6ebed96c16234c5c72804b548d79b5e",
      "skos:note": "Request for confidentiality of submission"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44le-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44LE(5) Council may invite public submissions on the application",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 170,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A person may, at the time of making a submission, request that the\nCouncil:\n\n(a) not make the whole or a part of the submission available\nunder subsection (4); and\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nServices that are ineligible to be declared  Division 2AA\n\nSection 44LF\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) not publish or make available the whole or a part of the\nsubmission under section 44LF;\nbecause of the confidential commercial information contained in\nthe submission."
    },
