    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44le-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44LE(6) Council may invite public submissions on the application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44le-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.170",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the Council refuses such a request:\n\n(a) for a written submission—the Council must, if the person\nwho made it so requires, return the whole or the part of it to\nthe person; and\n\n(b) for an oral submission—the person who made it may inform\nthe Council that the person withdraws the whole or the part\nof it; and\n\n(c) if the Council returns the whole or the part of the submission,\nor the person withdraws the whole or the part of the\nsubmission, the Council must not:\n\n(i) make the whole or the part of the submission available\nunder subsection (4); and\n\n(ii) publish or make available the whole or the part of the\nsubmission under section 44LF; and\n\n(iii) have regard to the whole or the part of the submission in\nmaking its recommendation on the application.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If the Council refuses such a request:\n\n(a) for a written submission—the Council must, if the person\nwho made it so requires, return the whole or the part of it to\nthe person; and\n\n(b) for an oral submission—the person who made it may inform\nthe Council that the person withdraws the whole or the part\nof it; and\n\n(c) if the Council returns the whole or the part of the submission,\nor the person withdraws the whole or the part of the\nsubmission, the Council must not:\n\n(i) make the whole or the part of the submission available\nunder subsection (4); and\n\n(ii) publish or make available the whole or the part of the\nsubmission under section 44LF; and\n\n(iii) have regard to the whole or the part of the submission in\nmaking its recommendation on the application.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44le"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44le-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44le-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "34024ccb898594429ca27ae749bc9671ab8e27d535bebaaef85ad09fbb0dd821",
      "skos:note": "Council must return written submissions if requested and withdraw oral submissions if required.",
      "dc:description": "return whole or part of submission, inform person withdrawing submission"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44le-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44LE(6) Council may invite public submissions on the application",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 170,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the Council refuses such a request:\n\n(a) for a written submission—the Council must, if the person\nwho made it so requires, return the whole or the part of it to\nthe person; and\n\n(b) for an oral submission—the person who made it may inform\nthe Council that the person withdraws the whole or the part\nof it; and\n\n(c) if the Council returns the whole or the part of the submission,\nor the person withdraws the whole or the part of the\nsubmission, the Council must not:\n\n(i) make the whole or the part of the submission available\nunder subsection (4); and\n\n(ii) publish or make available the whole or the part of the\nsubmission under section 44LF; and\n\n(iii) have regard to the whole or the part of the submission in\nmaking its recommendation on the application."
    },
