        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44lg-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.172",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The designated Minister must not decide that the service is\nineligible to be a declared service unless he or she is satisfied of\nboth of the following matters:\n\n(a) that the service is to be provided by means of the proposed\nfacility when constructed;\n\n(b) that he or she is not satisfied of at least one of the declaration\ncriteria for the service to be provided by means of the\nproposed facility.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The designated Minister must not decide that the service is\nineligible to be a declared service unless he or she is satisfied of\nboth of the following matters:\n\n(a) that the service is to be provided by means of the proposed\nfacility when constructed;\n\n(b) that he or she is not satisfied of at least one of the declaration\ncriteria for the service to be provided by means of the\nproposed facility.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44lg"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44lg-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44lg-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44lg-ss-5-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a0f30d6236bf2f5f4cb37ed2b27ebf19a524b85b3e4ef8625559268adc8c540a",
      "skos:note": "The designated Minister must be satisfied of certain matters before declaring a service ineligible."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44lg-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44LG(5) Designated Minister’s decision on ineligibility",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 172,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The designated Minister must not decide that the service is\nineligible to be a declared service unless he or she is satisfied of\nboth of the following matters:\n\n(a) that the service is to be provided by means of the proposed\nfacility when constructed;\n\n(b) that he or she is not satisfied of at least one of the declaration\ncriteria for the service to be provided by means of the\nproposed facility."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44lg-ss-5-norm",
