      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.174",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The designated Minister must have regard to any submission so\nmade in deciding what to publish. He or she may have regard to\nany other matter he or she considers relevant.\nSubdivision D—Revocation of ineligibility decision",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The designated Minister must have regard to any submission so\nmade in deciding what to publish. He or she may have regard to\nany other matter he or she considers relevant.\nSubdivision D—Revocation of ineligibility decision",
