    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44li-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44LI(1) Revocation of ineligibility decision",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 174,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Council may recommend to the designated Minister that the\ndesignated Minister revoke his or her decision (the ineligibility\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nServices that are ineligible to be declared  Division 2AA\n\nSection 44LI\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\ndecision) that a service is ineligible to be a declared service. The\nCouncil must have regard to the objects of this Part in making its\nrecommendation."
    },
