      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44m-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44M(3) Recommendation for a Ministerial decision on effectiveness of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44m-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.181",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Council must recommend to the Commonwealth Minister:\n\n(a) that he or she decide that the access regime is an effective\naccess regime for the service, or proposed service; or\n\n(b) that he or she decide that the access regime is not an effective\naccess regime for the service, or proposed service.\nNote 1:\nThere are time limits that apply to the Council’s recommendation: see\nsection 44NC.\nNote 2:\nThe Council may request information and invite public submissions\non the application: see sections 44MA and 44NE.\nNote 3:\nThe Council must publish its recommendation: see section 44NF.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Council must recommend to the Commonwealth Minister:\n\n(a) that he or she decide that the access regime is an effective\naccess regime for the service, or proposed service; or\n\n(b) that he or she decide that the access regime is not an effective\naccess regime for the service, or proposed service.\nNote 1:\nThere are time limits that apply to the Council’s recommendation: see\nsection 44NC.\nNote 2:\nThe Council may request information and invite public submissions\non the application: see sections 44MA and 44NE.\nNote 3:\nThe Council must publish its recommendation: see section 44NF.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44m"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44m-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44m-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ef5983428a9b957e2299c21af42a0ab1491c535d2b1a1170df856bdc7e8cc1bf",
      "skos:note": "Council must recommend to Commonwealth Minister on effectiveness of access regime."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44m-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44M(3) Recommendation for a Ministerial decision on effectiveness of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 181,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Council must recommend to the Commonwealth Minister:\n\n(a) that he or she decide that the access regime is an effective\naccess regime for the service, or proposed service; or\n\n(b) that he or she decide that the access regime is not an effective\naccess regime for the service, or proposed service.\nNote 1:\nThere are time limits that apply to the Council’s recommendation: see\nsection 44NC.\nNote 2:\nThe Council may request information and invite public submissions\non the application: see sections 44MA and 44NE.\nNote 3:\nThe Council must publish its recommendation: see section 44NF."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44m-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
