      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44m-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44M(4) Recommendation for a Ministerial decision on effectiveness of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44m-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.181",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In deciding what recommendation it should make, the Council:\n\n(a) must, subject to subsection (4A), assess whether the access\nregime is an effective access regime by applying the relevant\nprinciples set out in the Competition Principles Agreement;\nand\n\n(aa) must have regard to the objects of this Part; and\n\n(b) must, subject to section 44DA, not consider any other\nmatters.\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In deciding what recommendation it should make, the Council:\n\n(a) must, subject to subsection (4A), assess whether the access\nregime is an effective access regime by applying the relevant\nprinciples set out in the Competition Principles Agreement;\nand\n\n(aa) must have regard to the objects of this Part; and\n\n(b) must, subject to section 44DA, not consider any other\nmatters.\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44m"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44m-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44m-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "aec88850bf3f0811a853f660ba6174faec8ef2612b5304649d3ba836a28d0614",
      "skos:note": "Must assess effectiveness of access regime and consider objects of this Part"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44m-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44M(4) Recommendation for a Ministerial decision on effectiveness of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 181,
      "values:originalText": "(4) In deciding what recommendation it should make, the Council:\n\n(a) must, subject to subsection (4A), assess whether the access\nregime is an effective access regime by applying the relevant\nprinciples set out in the Competition Principles Agreement;\nand\n\n(aa) must have regard to the objects of this Part; and\n\n(b) must, subject to section 44DA, not consider any other\nmatters.\n\nChapter 2  Access to services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44m-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
