        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.182",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In deciding what recommendation to make on the application, the\nCouncil:\n\n(a) must have regard to any information given in compliance\nwith a notice under subsection (1) within the specified\nperiod; and\n\n(b) may disregard any information of the kind specified in the\nnotice that is given after the specified period has ended.\nSubdivision B—Decision by Commonwealth Minister",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In deciding what recommendation to make on the application, the\nCouncil:\n\n(a) must have regard to any information given in compliance\nwith a notice under subsection (1) within the specified\nperiod; and\n\n(b) may disregard any information of the kind specified in the\nnotice that is given after the specified period has ended.\nSubdivision B—Decision by Commonwealth Minister",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ma"
      },
