        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f40377f909727c167cbb02d4eee530fecfcb5444594e1bd213e4d445c623f73b",
      "skos:note": "Must consider information given within specified period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ma-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44MA(3) Council may request information",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 182,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In deciding what recommendation to make on the application, the\nCouncil:\n\n(a) must have regard to any information given in compliance\nwith a notice under subsection (1) within the specified\nperiod; and\n\n(b) may disregard any information of the kind specified in the\nnotice that is given after the specified period has ended.\nSubdivision B—Decision by Commonwealth Minister"
    },
    {
