    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44na-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44NA(2) Recommendation by Council",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 184,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The responsible Minister for the State or Territory may make a\nwritten application to the Council asking it to recommend that the\nCommonwealth Minister decide to extend the period for which the\ndecision is in force.\nNote:\nThe Commonwealth Minister may extend the period for which the\ndecision is in force more than once: see section 44NB. This means\nthere may be multiple applications under this subsection."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44na-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
