      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.184",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Council must assess whether the access regime (including any\nproposed variations) is an effective access regime. It must do this\nin accordance with subsection 44M(4).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Council must assess whether the access regime (including any\nproposed variations) is an effective access regime. It must do this\nin accordance with subsection 44M(4).",
