    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44na-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44NA(3) Recommendation by Council",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44na-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.184",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In deciding what recommendation to make on the application, the\nCouncil:\n\n(a) must have regard to any information given in compliance\nwith a notice under subsection (1) within the specified\nperiod; and\n\n(b) may disregard any information of the kind specified in the\nnotice that is given after the specified period has ended.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In deciding what recommendation to make on the application, the\nCouncil:\n\n(a) must have regard to any information given in compliance\nwith a notice under subsection (1) within the specified\nperiod; and\n\n(b) may disregard any information of the kind specified in the\nnotice that is given after the specified period has ended.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44na"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44na-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44na-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44na-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44na-ss-3-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8915b1633629ad4b15f73387b412a8678e1855d3df08597293302d0b88bfb542",
      "skos:note": "Must consider information given within specified period, may disregard later information. Minister may specify variations to access regime"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44na-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44NA(3) Recommendation by Council",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 184,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In deciding what recommendation to make on the application, the\nCouncil:\n\n(a) must have regard to any information given in compliance\nwith a notice under subsection (1) within the specified\nperiod; and\n\n(b) may disregard any information of the kind specified in the\nnotice that is given after the specified period has ended."
    },
