    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44nb",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44NB Decision by the Commonwealth Minister",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44nb"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.185",
      "values:originalText": "(1) On receiving a recommendation under section 44NA, the\nCommonwealth Minister must assess whether the access regime\n(including any proposed variations) is an effective access regime.\nHe or she must do this in accordance with subsection 44N(2).\nNote:\nThe Commonwealth Minister must publish his or her decision: see\nsection 44NG.\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "skos:definition": "(1) On receiving a recommendation under section 44NA, the\nCommonwealth Minister must assess whether the access regime\n(including any proposed variations) is an effective access regime.\nHe or she must do this in accordance with subsection 44N(2).\nNote:\nThe Commonwealth Minister must publish his or her decision: see\nsection 44NG.\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44nb-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44nb-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e67141bd964b6404bb126c67f79c934a930f9dcd117674cc96bd323e060ac5ad",
      "skos:note": "Must assess effectiveness of access regime upon receiving recommendation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44nb",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44NB Decision by the Commonwealth Minister",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 185,
      "values:originalText": "(1) On receiving a recommendation under section 44NA, the\nCommonwealth Minister must assess whether the access regime\n(including any proposed variations) is an effective access regime.\nHe or she must do this in accordance with subsection 44N(2).\nNote:\nThe Commonwealth Minister must publish his or her decision: see\nsection 44NG.\n\nChapter 2  Access to services"
    },
