      "cml:integrityHash": "0843b4c94e4d94ea7e4670edd8c25ad36f2465f6d2c1079ec00d78cd3a571117",
      "skos:note": "Request for confidentiality of submission"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ne-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44NE(5) Council may invite public submissions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 192,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A person may, at the time of making a submission, request that the\nCouncil:\n\n(a) not make the whole or a part of the submission available\nunder subsection (4); and\n\n(b) not publish or make available the whole or a part of the\nsubmission under section 44NF;\nbecause of the confidential commercial information contained in\nthe submission."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ne-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ne-ss-5"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ne-ss-5-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "request",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Request for permission",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Person may request",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Council may invite submission with confidentiality"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ne-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44NE(6) Council may invite public submissions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ne-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.192",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the Council refuses such a request:\n\n(a) for a written submission—the Council must, if the person\nwho made it so requires, return the whole or the part of it to\nthe person; and\n\n(b) for an oral submission—the person who made it may inform\nthe Council that the person withdraws the whole or the part\nof it; and\n\n(c) if the Council returns the whole or the part of the submission,\nor the person withdraws the whole or the part of the\nsubmission, the Council must not:\n\n(i) make the whole or the part of the submission available\nunder subsection (4); and\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If the Council refuses such a request:\n\n(a) for a written submission—the Council must, if the person\nwho made it so requires, return the whole or the part of it to\nthe person; and\n\n(b) for an oral submission—the person who made it may inform\nthe Council that the person withdraws the whole or the part\nof it; and\n\n(c) if the Council returns the whole or the part of the submission,\nor the person withdraws the whole or the part of the\nsubmission, the Council must not:\n\n(i) make the whole or the part of the submission available\nunder subsection (4); and\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ne"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ne-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ne-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "799eddbb4cce1084394cf10f54cac354460efb307d5bf126defd3ca7b5148ce1",
      "skos:note": "Council must return written or oral submissions if requested"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ne-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44NE(6) Council may invite public submissions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 192,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the Council refuses such a request:\n\n(a) for a written submission—the Council must, if the person\nwho made it so requires, return the whole or the part of it to\nthe person; and\n\n(b) for an oral submission—the person who made it may inform\nthe Council that the person withdraws the whole or the part\nof it; and\n\n(c) if the Council returns the whole or the part of the submission,\nor the person withdraws the whole or the part of the\nsubmission, the Council must not:\n\n(i) make the whole or the part of the submission available\nunder subsection (4); and\n\nChapter 2  Access to services"
    },
