      },
      "cml:operator": "IMPLIES",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Describes a causal relationship",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Consultation",
      "cml:conclusionText": "If there is consultation, then the Council must take action"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44nf-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44NF(4) Publication—Council",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44nf-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.194",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Before publishing under subsection (1), the Council may give any\none or more of the following persons:\n\n(a) the applicant under section 44M or 44NA, or under\nsection 44NBA (unless the recommendation relates to a\nconsideration by the Council under that section on its own\ninitiative);\n\n(b) the provider of the service;\n\n(c) any other person the Council considers appropriate;\na notice in writing:\n\n(d) specifying what the Council is proposing to publish; and\n\n(e) inviting the person to make a written submission to the\nCouncil within 14 days after the notice is given identifying\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nEffective access regimes  Division 2A\n\nSection 44NG\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nany information the person considers should not be published\nbecause of its confidential commercial nature.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Before publishing under subsection (1), the Council may give any\none or more of the following persons:\n\n(a) the applicant under section 44M or 44NA, or under\nsection 44NBA (unless the recommendation relates to a\nconsideration by the Council under that section on its own\ninitiative);\n\n(b) the provider of the service;\n\n(c) any other person the Council considers appropriate;\na notice in writing:\n\n(d) specifying what the Council is proposing to publish; and\n\n(e) inviting the person to make a written submission to the\nCouncil within 14 days after the notice is given identifying\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nEffective access regimes  Division 2A\n\nSection 44NG\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nany information the person considers should not be published\nbecause of its confidential commercial nature.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44nf"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44nf-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44nf-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e790960a4c7a56264e62e7067959efc8d669b6a8c2abcb0ccfce863383eeb9dc",
      "skos:note": "Notice must be given to persons before publishing under subsection (1)",
      "dc:description": "Notice in writing, specifying what the Council is proposing to publish"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44nf-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44NF(4) Publication—Council",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 194,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Before publishing under subsection (1), the Council may give any\none or more of the following persons:\n\n(a) the applicant under section 44M or 44NA, or under\nsection 44NBA (unless the recommendation relates to a\nconsideration by the Council under that section on its own\ninitiative);\n\n(b) the provider of the service;\n\n(c) any other person the Council considers appropriate;\na notice in writing:\n\n(d) specifying what the Council is proposing to publish; and\n\n(e) inviting the person to make a written submission to the\nCouncil within 14 days after the notice is given identifying\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nEffective access regimes  Division 2A\n\nSection 44NG\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nany information the person considers should not be published\nbecause of its confidential commercial nature."
    },
