      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.194",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The Council must have regard to any submission so made in\ndeciding what to publish. It may have regard to any other matter it\nconsiders relevant.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The Council must have regard to any submission so made in\ndeciding what to publish. It may have regard to any other matter it\nconsiders relevant.",
