      "skos:note": "The Council must consider submissions when deciding what to publish."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44nf-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44NF(5) Publication—Council",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 194,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The Council must have regard to any submission so made in\ndeciding what to publish. It may have regard to any other matter it\nconsiders relevant."
    },
