    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44o-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44O(3) Review of Ministerial decision on effectiveness of access regime",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44o-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.196",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The review by the Tribunal is a reconsideration of the matter based\non the information, reports and things referred to in\nsection 44ZZOAA.\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nEffective access regimes  Division 2A\n\nSection 44P\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nNote:\nThere are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have\nregard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the\nTribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The review by the Tribunal is a reconsideration of the matter based\non the information, reports and things referred to in\nsection 44ZZOAA.\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nEffective access regimes  Division 2A\n\nSection 44P\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nNote:\nThere are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have\nregard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the\nTribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44o"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44o-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44o-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44o-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44o-ss-3-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44o-ss-3-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a8bb324f09034a2eb954fd402169a8ddeccb429cd3756b6388d8f2536bab68c2",
      "skos:note": "Tribunal must reconsider ministerial decision on effectiveness of access regime based on specified information and reports."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44o-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44O(3) Review of Ministerial decision on effectiveness of access regime",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 196,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The review by the Tribunal is a reconsideration of the matter based\non the information, reports and things referred to in\nsection 44ZZOAA.\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nEffective access regimes  Division 2A\n\nSection 44P\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nNote:\nThere are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have\nregard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the\nTribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44o-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
