    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44pe-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44PE(3) Commission may invite public submissions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44pe-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.205",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subject to subsection (6), in making its decision, the Commission:\n\n(a) must have regard to any submission made on or before the\nday specified in the notice; and\n\n(b) may disregard any submission made after the day specified in\nthe notice.\nCommission may make submissions publicly available",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Subject to subsection (6), in making its decision, the Commission:\n\n(a) must have regard to any submission made on or before the\nday specified in the notice; and\n\n(b) may disregard any submission made after the day specified in\nthe notice.\nCommission may make submissions publicly available",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44pe"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44pe-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44pe-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c32ecd8a740ecbc86e61c03a0cc4b5707ffe29d4ebe260e867f49dafb2cb8c0d",
      "skos:note": "Must consider submissions made on or before specified day"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44pe-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44PE(3) Commission may invite public submissions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 205,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subject to subsection (6), in making its decision, the Commission:\n\n(a) must have regard to any submission made on or before the\nday specified in the notice; and\n\n(b) may disregard any submission made after the day specified in\nthe notice.\nCommission may make submissions publicly available"
    },
