      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.206",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commission must give a copy of the publication to:\n\n(a) for any decision—the applicant under subsection 44PA(1);\nand\n\n(b) for a decision under subsection 44PC(2)—the provider of the\nservice.\nIt may also give a copy to any other person the Commission\nconsiders appropriate.\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nCompetitive tender processes for government owned facilities  Division 2B\n\nSection 44PG\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nConsultation",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Commission must give a copy of the publication to:\n\n(a) for any decision—the applicant under subsection 44PA(1);\nand\n\n(b) for a decision under subsection 44PC(2)—the provider of the\nservice.\nIt may also give a copy to any other person the Commission\nconsiders appropriate.\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nCompetitive tender processes for government owned facilities  Division 2B\n\nSection 44PG\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nConsultation",
