    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44pf-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44PF(3) Commission must publish its decisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44pf-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.206",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Before publishing under subsection (1), the Commission may give\nthe following persons:\n\n(a) for any decision—the applicant under subsection 44PA(1) or\nany other person the Commission considers appropriate;\n\n(b) for a decision under subsection 44PC(2)—the provider of the\nservice;\na notice in writing:\n\n(c) specifying what the Commission is proposing to publish; and\n\n(d) inviting the person to make a written submission to the\nCommission within 14 days after the notice is given\nidentifying any information the person considers should not\nbe published because of its confidential commercial nature.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Before publishing under subsection (1), the Commission may give\nthe following persons:\n\n(a) for any decision—the applicant under subsection 44PA(1) or\nany other person the Commission considers appropriate;\n\n(b) for a decision under subsection 44PC(2)—the provider of the\nservice;\na notice in writing:\n\n(c) specifying what the Commission is proposing to publish; and\n\n(d) inviting the person to make a written submission to the\nCommission within 14 days after the notice is given\nidentifying any information the person considers should not\nbe published because of its confidential commercial nature.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44pf"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44pf-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44pf-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44pf-ss-3-logic-linearlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44pf-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44pf-ss-3-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "39b9c07e0ef88038aa1f04124b5b6217d5470aae5829cfb74035304da5984c7e",
      "skos:note": "Commission must give notice to certain persons before publishing decisions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44pf-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44PF(3) Commission must publish its decisions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 206,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Before publishing under subsection (1), the Commission may give\nthe following persons:\n\n(a) for any decision—the applicant under subsection 44PA(1) or\nany other person the Commission considers appropriate;\n\n(b) for a decision under subsection 44PC(2)—the provider of the\nservice;\na notice in writing:\n\n(c) specifying what the Commission is proposing to publish; and\n\n(d) inviting the person to make a written submission to the\nCommission within 14 days after the notice is given\nidentifying any information the person considers should not\nbe published because of its confidential commercial nature."
    },
