      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.209",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The review by the Tribunal is a reconsideration of the matter based\non the information, reports and things referred to in\nsection 44ZZOAA.\nNote:\nThere are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have\nregard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the\nTribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The review by the Tribunal is a reconsideration of the matter based\non the information, reports and things referred to in\nsection 44ZZOAA.\nNote:\nThere are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have\nregard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the\nTribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ph"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ph-ss-3-norm"
