      "skos:note": "Reconsideration of decision to revoke an approval based on specified information and reports."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ph-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44PH(3) Review of decision to revoke an approval",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 209,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The review by the Tribunal is a reconsideration of the matter based\non the information, reports and things referred to in\nsection 44ZZOAA.\nNote:\nThere are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have\nregard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the\nTribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA)."
    },
