    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44u",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44U Parties to the arbitration",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44u"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.213",
      "values:originalText": "The parties to the arbitration of an access dispute are:\n\n(a) the provider;\n\n(b) the third party;\n\n(c) any other person who applies in writing to be made a party\nand is accepted by the Commission as having a sufficient\ninterest.",
      "skos:definition": "The parties to the arbitration of an access dispute are:\n\n(a) the provider;\n\n(b) the third party;\n\n(c) any other person who applies in writing to be made a party\nand is accepted by the Commission as having a sufficient\ninterest.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44u-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ca7218f87d3dcb9f4464123bd6e99e41f5fc31b23f3a13a5228f95a2754c1c7b",
      "skos:note": "List of parties to arbitration"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44u",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44U Parties to the arbitration",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 213,
      "values:originalText": "The parties to the arbitration of an access dispute are:\n\n(a) the provider;\n\n(b) the third party;\n\n(c) any other person who applies in writing to be made a party\nand is accepted by the Commission as having a sufficient\ninterest."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44u-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44u"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44v",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44V Determination by Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44v"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.213",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Unless it terminates the arbitration under section 44Y, 44YA,\n44ZZCB or 44ZZCBA, the Commission:\n\n(a) must make a written final determination; and\n\n(b) may make a written interim determination;\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Unless it terminates the arbitration under section 44Y, 44YA,\n44ZZCB or 44ZZCBA, the Commission:\n\n(a) must make a written final determination; and\n\n(b) may make a written interim determination;\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44v-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44v-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7cb60930ab55f16f67f8293403ebce215d1d68f7163e47e9e5a5dfb874bc57a2",
      "skos:note": "Must make written final determination unless terminating arbitration under specified sections.",
      "dc:description": "Written final determination"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44v",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44V Determination by Commission",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 213,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Unless it terminates the arbitration under section 44Y, 44YA,\n44ZZCB or 44ZZCBA, the Commission:\n\n(a) must make a written final determination; and\n\n(b) may make a written interim determination;\n\nChapter 2  Access to services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44v-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44v"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44v-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must make written final determination",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
