    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44w-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44W(2) Restrictions on access determinations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 215,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Paragraphs (1)(a) and (b) do not apply in relation to the\nrequirements and rights of the third party and the provider when\nthe Commission is making a determination in arbitration of an\naccess dispute relating to an earlier determination of an access\ndispute between the third party and the provider.\n\nChapter 2  Access to services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44w-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44w-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
