      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commission must make a final determination within the\nperiod of 180 days (the expected period) starting at the start of the\nday the application is received.\nStopping the clock",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commission must make a final determination within the\nperiod of 180 days (the expected period) starting at the start of the\nday the application is received.\nStopping the clock",
