    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44xa-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44XA(2) Time limit for Commission’s final determination",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44xa-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.218",
      "values:originalText": "(2) In working out the expected period in relation to a final\ndetermination, in a situation referred to in column 1 of an item of\nthe following table, disregard any day in a period:\n\n(a) starting on the day referred to in column 2 of the item; and\n\n(b) ending on the day referred to in column 3 of the item.\n\nStopping the clock\nItem\nColumn 1\nSituation\nColumn 2\nStart day\nColumn 3\nEnd day\nAn agreement is made in\nrelation to the arbitration\nunder subsection (4)\nThe first day of\nthe period\nspecified in the\nagreement\nThe last day of the period\nspecified in the agreement\nA direction is given\nunder\nsubsection 44ZG(1) to\ngive information or make\na submission within a\nspecified period\nThe first day of\nthe period\nspecified for the\ngiving of the\ninformation or\nthe making of\nthe submission\nThe last day of the period\nspecified for the giving of\nthe information or the\nmaking of the submission\nA decision is published\nunder\nsubsection 44ZZCB(4)\ndeferring consideration\nof the dispute while the\nCommission considers\nan access undertaking\nThe day on\nwhich the\ndecision is\npublished\nThe day on which the\nCommission makes its\ndecision on the access\nundertaking under\nsubsection 44ZZA(3)\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nAccess to declared services  Division 3\n\nSection 44Y\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nStopping the clock\nItem\nColumn 1\nSituation\nColumn 2\nStart day\nColumn 3\nEnd day\nThe Commission, under\nsubsection 44ZZCBA(1)\nor (2), defers arbitrating\nthe dispute while a\ndeclaration is under\nreview by the Tribunal\nThe day on\nwhich the\nCommission\ngives the notice\nto defer\narbitrating the\ndispute\nThe day the Tribunal makes\nits decision under\nsection 44K on the review",
      "skos:definition": "(2) In working out the expected period in relation to a final\ndetermination, in a situation referred to in column 1 of an item of\nthe following table, disregard any day in a period:\n\n(a) starting on the day referred to in column 2 of the item; and\n\n(b) ending on the day referred to in column 3 of the item.\n\nStopping the clock\nItem\nColumn 1\nSituation\nColumn 2\nStart day\nColumn 3\nEnd day\nAn agreement is made in\nrelation to the arbitration\nunder subsection (4)\nThe first day of\nthe period\nspecified in the\nagreement\nThe last day of the period\nspecified in the agreement\nA direction is given\nunder\nsubsection 44ZG(1) to\ngive information or make\na submission within a\nspecified period\nThe first day of\nthe period\nspecified for the\ngiving of the\ninformation or\nthe making of\nthe submission\nThe last day of the period\nspecified for the giving of\nthe information or the\nmaking of the submission\nA decision is published\nunder\nsubsection 44ZZCB(4)\ndeferring consideration\nof the dispute while the\nCommission considers\nan access undertaking\nThe day on\nwhich the\ndecision is\npublished\nThe day on which the\nCommission makes its\ndecision on the access\nundertaking under\nsubsection 44ZZA(3)\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nAccess to declared services  Division 3\n\nSection 44Y\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nStopping the clock\nItem\nColumn 1\nSituation\nColumn 2\nStart day\nColumn 3\nEnd day\nThe Commission, under\nsubsection 44ZZCBA(1)\nor (2), defers arbitrating\nthe dispute while a\ndeclaration is under\nreview by the Tribunal\nThe day on\nwhich the\nCommission\ngives the notice\nto defer\narbitrating the\ndispute\nThe day the Tribunal makes\nits decision under\nsection 44K on the review",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44xa"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44xa-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44xa-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44xa-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "92ca60c13e16eb7e0844e99ef6bed849b6705da7aedc3f01479687d80b0e87bc",
      "skos:note": "Disregard certain days when working out the expected period for a final determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44xa-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44XA(2) Time limit for Commission’s final determination",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 218,
      "values:originalText": "(2) In working out the expected period in relation to a final\ndetermination, in a situation referred to in column 1 of an item of\nthe following table, disregard any day in a period:\n\n(a) starting on the day referred to in column 2 of the item; and\n\n(b) ending on the day referred to in column 3 of the item.\n\nStopping the clock\nItem\nColumn 1\nSituation\nColumn 2\nStart day\nColumn 3\nEnd day\nAn agreement is made in\nrelation to the arbitration\nunder subsection (4)\nThe first day of\nthe period\nspecified in the\nagreement\nThe last day of the period\nspecified in the agreement\nA direction is given\nunder\nsubsection 44ZG(1) to\ngive information or make\na submission within a\nspecified period\nThe first day of\nthe period\nspecified for the\ngiving of the\ninformation or\nthe making of\nthe submission\nThe last day of the period\nspecified for the giving of\nthe information or the\nmaking of the submission\nA decision is published\nunder\nsubsection 44ZZCB(4)\ndeferring consideration\nof the dispute while the\nCommission considers\nan access undertaking\nThe day on\nwhich the\ndecision is\npublished\nThe day on which the\nCommission makes its\ndecision on the access\nundertaking under\nsubsection 44ZZA(3)\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nAccess to declared services  Division 3\n\nSection 44Y\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nStopping the clock\nItem\nColumn 1\nSituation\nColumn 2\nStart day\nColumn 3\nEnd day\nThe Commission, under\nsubsection 44ZZCBA(1)\nor (2), defers arbitrating\nthe dispute while a\ndeclaration is under\nreview by the Tribunal\nThe day on\nwhich the\nCommission\ngives the notice\nto defer\narbitrating the\ndispute\nThe day the Tribunal makes\nits decision under\nsection 44K on the review"
    },
