    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44xa-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44XA(6) Time limit for Commission’s final determination",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44xa-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.218",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the Commission does not publish under section 44ZNB a written\nreport about a final determination within the expected period, it is\ntaken, immediately after the end of the expected period, to have:\n\n(a) made a final determination that does not impose any\nobligations on the parties or alter any obligations (if any) that\nexist at that time between the parties; and\n\n(b) published a written report about the final determination under\nsection 44ZNB.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If the Commission does not publish under section 44ZNB a written\nreport about a final determination within the expected period, it is\ntaken, immediately after the end of the expected period, to have:\n\n(a) made a final determination that does not impose any\nobligations on the parties or alter any obligations (if any) that\nexist at that time between the parties; and\n\n(b) published a written report about the final determination under\nsection 44ZNB.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44xa"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44xa-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44xa-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9828f4f3628c81c2006a2a19e3c1d0705f329ef644245533ffb65939460e87e2",
      "skos:note": "Commission's final determination if report not published on time"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44xa-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44XA(6) Time limit for Commission’s final determination",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 218,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the Commission does not publish under section 44ZNB a written\nreport about a final determination within the expected period, it is\ntaken, immediately after the end of the expected period, to have:\n\n(a) made a final determination that does not impose any\nobligations on the parties or alter any obligations (if any) that\nexist at that time between the parties; and\n\n(b) published a written report about the final determination under\nsection 44ZNB."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44xa-ss-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
