      "cml:conclusionText": "Chairperson nomination"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44za",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44ZA Member of the Commission presiding at an arbitration",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44za"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.220",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subsection (2), the Chairperson is to preside at an\narbitration.\n\n(2) If the Chairperson is not a member of the Commission as\nconstituted under section 44Z in relation to a particular arbitration,\nthe Chairperson must nominate a member of the Commission to\npreside at the arbitration.\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nAccess to declared services  Division 3\n\nSection 44ZB\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to subsection (2), the Chairperson is to preside at an\narbitration.\n\n(2) If the Chairperson is not a member of the Commission as\nconstituted under section 44Z in relation to a particular arbitration,\nthe Chairperson must nominate a member of the Commission to\npreside at the arbitration.\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nAccess to declared services  Division 3\n\nSection 44ZB\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44za-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44za-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3b3e8f726edc3d9adbc09f65941f8ab437f74ccfaf1be0edcc23ec34c136b74e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44za",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44ZA Member of the Commission presiding at an arbitration",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 220,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subsection (2), the Chairperson is to preside at an\narbitration.\n\n(2) If the Chairperson is not a member of the Commission as\nconstituted under section 44Z in relation to a particular arbitration,\nthe Chairperson must nominate a member of the Commission to\npreside at the arbitration.\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nAccess to declared services  Division 3\n\nSection 44ZB\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
