      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zb",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44ZB Reconstitution of Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44zb"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.221",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a member of the Commission who is one of\nthe members who constitute the Commission for the purposes of a\nparticular arbitration:\n\n(a) stops being a member of the Commission; or\n\n(b) for any reason, is not available for the purpose of the\narbitration.\n\n(2) The Chairperson must either:\n\n(a) direct that the Commission is to be constituted for the\npurposes of finishing the arbitration by the remaining\nmember or members; or\n\n(b) direct that the Commission is to be constituted for that\npurpose by the remaining member or members together with\none or more other members of the Commission.\n\n(3) If a direction under subsection (2) is given, the Commission as\nconstituted in accordance with the direction must continue and\nfinish the arbitration and may, for that purpose, have regard to any\nrecord of the proceedings of the arbitration made by the\nCommission as previously constituted.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if a member of the Commission who is one of\nthe members who constitute the Commission for the purposes of a\nparticular arbitration:\n\n(a) stops being a member of the Commission; or\n\n(b) for any reason, is not available for the purpose of the\narbitration.\n\n(2) The Chairperson must either:\n\n(a) direct that the Commission is to be constituted for the\npurposes of finishing the arbitration by the remaining\nmember or members; or\n\n(b) direct that the Commission is to be constituted for that\npurpose by the remaining member or members together with\none or more other members of the Commission.\n\n(3) If a direction under subsection (2) is given, the Commission as\nconstituted in accordance with the direction must continue and\nfinish the arbitration and may, for that purpose, have regard to any\nrecord of the proceedings of the arbitration made by the\nCommission as previously constituted.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zb-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zb-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zb-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d62e328a9a547b90dfa153f2fbcf8d33216a736f7239350683801421a0b52a61"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44zb",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44ZB Reconstitution of Commission",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 221,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a member of the Commission who is one of\nthe members who constitute the Commission for the purposes of a\nparticular arbitration:\n\n(a) stops being a member of the Commission; or\n\n(b) for any reason, is not available for the purpose of the\narbitration.\n\n(2) The Chairperson must either:\n\n(a) direct that the Commission is to be constituted for the\npurposes of finishing the arbitration by the remaining\nmember or members; or\n\n(b) direct that the Commission is to be constituted for that\npurpose by the remaining member or members together with\none or more other members of the Commission.\n\n(3) If a direction under subsection (2) is given, the Commission as\nconstituted in accordance with the direction must continue and\nfinish the arbitration and may, for that purpose, have regard to any\nrecord of the proceedings of the arbitration made by the\nCommission as previously constituted."
    },
