        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) The specified day must not be earlier than the following day:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44ZO(5) Operation of final determinations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44zo-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.230",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If a provision of a final determination is expressed to apply from a\nday when an interim determination was in effect, the provision of\nthe final determination prevails over the interim determination to\nthe extent set out in the final determination.\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nAccess to declared services  Division 3\n\nSection 44ZOA\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nInterest",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If a provision of a final determination is expressed to apply from a\nday when an interim determination was in effect, the provision of\nthe final determination prevails over the interim determination to\nthe extent set out in the final determination.\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nAccess to declared services  Division 3\n\nSection 44ZOA\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nInterest",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5-norm"
        },
