          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4c2fbf14dbce2917ea575da6483a63873cd5830ea1f5f6847c5d61b66428c09a",
      "skos:note": "Final determination prevails over interim determination to the extent set out in the final determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44zo-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44ZO(5) Operation of final determinations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 230,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If a provision of a final determination is expressed to apply from a\nday when an interim determination was in effect, the provision of\nthe final determination prevails over the interim determination to\nthe extent set out in the final determination.\n\nAccess to services  Chapter 2\nAccess to services  Part IIIA\nAccess to declared services  Division 3\n\nSection 44ZOA\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nInterest"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "prevails",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to prioritize final determination over interim determination.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) If a provision of a final determination is expressed to apply from a day when an interim determination was in effect, the provision of the final determination prevails over the interim determination to the extent set out in the final determination.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The final determination prevails over the interim determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Provision applies during the time period specified by the final determination.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) If a provision of a final determination is expressed to apply from a day when an interim determination was in effect, the provision of the final determination prevails over the interim determination to the extent set out in the final determination.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The provision applies during the time period specified by the final determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Provision is true during the time period specified by the final determination.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) If a provision of a final determination is expressed to apply from a day when an interim determination was in effect, the provision of the final determination prevails over the interim determination to the extent set out in the final determination.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The provision is true during the time period specified by the final determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Provision spreads or propagates during the time period specified by the final determination.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) If a provision of a final determination is expressed to apply from a day when an interim determination was in effect, the provision of the final determination prevails over the interim determination to the extent set out in the final determination.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The provision spreads or propagates during the time period specified by the final determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-5-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Provision is executed during the time period specified by the final determination.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) If a provision of a final determination is expressed to apply from a day when an interim determination was in effect, the provision of the final determination prevails over the interim determination to the extent set out in the final determination.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The provision is executed during the time period specified by the final determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44ZO(6) Operation of final determinations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44zo-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.230",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If:\n\n(a) a provision of a final determination is covered by\nsubsection (3); and\n\n(b) the provision requires a party to the determination (the first\nparty) to pay money to another party;\nthe determination may require the first party to pay interest to the\nother party, at the rate specified in the determination, on the whole\nor a part of the money, for the whole or a part of the period:\n\n(c) beginning on the day specified under subsection (3); and\n\n(d) ending on the day on which the determination takes effect\nunder subsection (1) or (2).\nGuidelines",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If:\n\n(a) a provision of a final determination is covered by\nsubsection (3); and\n\n(b) the provision requires a party to the determination (the first\nparty) to pay money to another party;\nthe determination may require the first party to pay interest to the\nother party, at the rate specified in the determination, on the whole\nor a part of the money, for the whole or a part of the period:\n\n(c) beginning on the day specified under subsection (3); and\n\n(d) ending on the day on which the determination takes effect\nunder subsection (1) or (2).\nGuidelines",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "82f1f20cd938cff092dedb6258a2a5f3c5ff70777d23256521862e3fe76e19bc",
      "skos:note": "First party must pay interest to other party."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44zo-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44ZO(6) Operation of final determinations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 230,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If:\n\n(a) a provision of a final determination is covered by\nsubsection (3); and\n\n(b) the provision requires a party to the determination (the first\nparty) to pay money to another party;\nthe determination may require the first party to pay interest to the\nother party, at the rate specified in the determination, on the whole\nor a part of the money, for the whole or a part of the period:\n\n(c) beginning on the day specified under subsection (3); and\n\n(d) ending on the day on which the determination takes effect\nunder subsection (1) or (2).\nGuidelines"
    },
    {
