      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.230",
      "values:originalText": "(7) In exercising the power conferred by subsection (3) or (6), the\nCommission must have regard to any guidelines in force under\nsubsection (8). It may have regard to any other matter it considers\nrelevant.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) In exercising the power conferred by subsection (3) or (6), the\nCommission must have regard to any guidelines in force under\nsubsection (8). It may have regard to any other matter it considers\nrelevant.",
