      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.230",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An interim determination takes effect on the day specified in the\ndetermination.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An interim determination takes effect on the day specified in the\ndetermination.",
