    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44ZO(2) Operation of final determinations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44zo-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.230",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Unless sooner revoked, an interim determination continues in\neffect until the earliest of the following:\n\n(a) the notification of the access dispute is withdrawn under\nsection 44T;\n\n(b) a final determination relating to the access dispute takes\neffect;\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Unless sooner revoked, an interim determination continues in\neffect until the earliest of the following:\n\n(a) the notification of the access dispute is withdrawn under\nsection 44T;\n\n(b) a final determination relating to the access dispute takes\neffect;\n\nChapter 2  Access to services",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "261c0dbe23a7e7bd65208386e275cd3e34e6106d348bdb91e4f2ec7abe146026",
      "skos:note": "Determination is of no effect until review by Tribunal. Continuation of interim determination until earliest of two events"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44zo-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44ZO(2) Operation of final determinations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 230,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Unless sooner revoked, an interim determination continues in\neffect until the earliest of the following:\n\n(a) the notification of the access dispute is withdrawn under\nsection 44T;\n\n(b) a final determination relating to the access dispute takes\neffect;\n\nChapter 2  Access to services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zo-ss-2-norm",
