      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.232",
      "values:originalText": "(7) The determination, as affirmed or varied by the Tribunal, is to be\ntaken to be a determination of the Commission for all purposes of\nthis Part (except this section).",
      "skos:definition": "(7) The determination, as affirmed or varied by the Tribunal, is to be\ntaken to be a determination of the Commission for all purposes of\nthis Part (except this section).",
      "values:partOf": {
