      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.233",
      "values:originalText": "Sections 37, 39 to 43 (inclusive) and 103 to 110 (inclusive) do not\napply in relation to a review by the Tribunal of a final\ndetermination made by the Commission.",
      "skos:definition": "Sections 37, 39 to 43 (inclusive) and 103 to 110 (inclusive) do not\napply in relation to a review by the Tribunal of a final\ndetermination made by the Commission.",
