      "values:originalText": "(2A) The Commission must not register a contract if it deals with a\nmatter or matters relating to access to the service that are dealt with\nin an access undertaking that is in operation.",
      "skos:definition": "(2A) The Commission must not register a contract if it deals with a\nmatter or matters relating to access to the service that are dealt with\nin an access undertaking that is in operation.",
      "values:partOf": {
