      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.237",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The review by the Tribunal is a re-consideration of the matter\nbased on the information, reports and things referred to in\nsection 44ZZOAA.\nNote:\nThere are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have\nregard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the\nTribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The review by the Tribunal is a re-consideration of the matter\nbased on the information, reports and things referred to in\nsection 44ZZOAA.\nNote:\nThere are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have\nregard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the\nTribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zx"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zx-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44zx-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c8be2371c8a964da188fa42d5783c1b61ffe077975811c82b7c13074792f21f8",
      "skos:note": "Tribunal must re-consider decision not to register contract based on specified information and reports."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44zx-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44ZX(3) Review of decision not to register contract",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 237,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The review by the Tribunal is a re-consideration of the matter\nbased on the information, reports and things referred to in\nsection 44ZZOAA.\nNote:\nThere are limits on the information to which the Tribunal may have\nregard (see section 44ZZOAA) and time limits that apply to the\nTribunal’s decision on the review (see section 44ZZOA)."
    },
