    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45af-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45AF(3) Making a contract etc. containing a cartel provision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45af-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.291",
      "values:originalText": "(3) An offence against subsection (1) is punishable on conviction by a\nfine not exceeding the greater of the following:\n\n(a) $100,000,000;\n\n(b) if the court can determine the total value of the benefits that:\n\n(i) have been obtained by one or more persons; and\n\n(ii) are reasonably attributable to the commission of the\noffence;\n\n3 times that total value;\n\nChapter 3  Restrictive trade practices",
      "skos:definition": "(3) An offence against subsection (1) is punishable on conviction by a\nfine not exceeding the greater of the following:\n\n(a) $100,000,000;\n\n(b) if the court can determine the total value of the benefits that:\n\n(i) have been obtained by one or more persons; and\n\n(ii) are reasonably attributable to the commission of the\noffence;\n\n3 times that total value;\n\nChapter 3  Restrictive trade practices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45af"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45af-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45af-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "758fb94e9584c522dc91a1a6fad2e3b6246d5906d04610d4015ae79cff92d515",
      "skos:note": "Offence punishable by fine not exceeding $100,000,000 or 3 times the total value of benefits obtained"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45af-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45AF(3) Making a contract etc. containing a cartel provision",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 291,
      "values:originalText": "(3) An offence against subsection (1) is punishable on conviction by a\nfine not exceeding the greater of the following:\n\n(a) $100,000,000;\n\n(b) if the court can determine the total value of the benefits that:\n\n(i) have been obtained by one or more persons; and\n\n(ii) are reasonably attributable to the commission of the\noffence;\n\n3 times that total value;\n\nChapter 3  Restrictive trade practices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45af-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45af-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45af-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibition",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Imposes a prohibition on committing the offence",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
