      "cml:integrityHash": "031cae2656d2afbe387bde22eb3a147b7e1d8c3c43724af92b872146a415d698",
      "skos:note": "A corporation can be held guilty of an offence against section 45AF or 45AG even if other parties are not criminally responsible."
