    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ap",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45AP Joint ventures—civil penalty proceedings",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45ap"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.297",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 45AJ and 45AK do not apply in relation to a contract,\narrangement or understanding containing a cartel provision if the\ndefendant proves that:\n\n(a) the cartel provision is:\n\n(i) for the purposes of a joint venture; and\n\nChapter 3  Restrictive trade practices",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Sections 45AJ and 45AK do not apply in relation to a contract,\narrangement or understanding containing a cartel provision if the\ndefendant proves that:\n\n(a) the cartel provision is:\n\n(i) for the purposes of a joint venture; and\n\nChapter 3  Restrictive trade practices",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ap-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f22d954e1b33aeeefb7994e1c42dba42f28d81fa9c315a93cf2a27e4f13c4c89",
      "skos:note": "No application of sections 45AJ and 45AK in relation to a cartel provision for joint ventures."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45ap",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45AP Joint ventures—civil penalty proceedings",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 297,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 45AJ and 45AK do not apply in relation to a contract,\narrangement or understanding containing a cartel provision if the\ndefendant proves that:\n\n(a) the cartel provision is:\n\n(i) for the purposes of a joint venture; and\n\nChapter 3  Restrictive trade practices"
    },
    {
