      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.304",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a person is the notifying party of a notification of an\nacquisition; and\n\n(b) a change of fact occurs; and\n\n(c) the change of fact is material to the Commission making a\ndetermination under subsection 51ABZE(1) in respect of the\nnotification; and\n\n(d) the person becomes aware of the change of fact at a time:\n\n(i) occurring on or after the effective notification date of\nthe notification; and\n\n(ii) at which the Commission has not decided to cease\nconsidering the notification under section 51ABZD; and\n\n(iii) at which the Commission has not made a determination\nin respect of the notification under\nsubsection 51ABZE(1); and\n\n(iv) if the notification is subject to phase 2 review—\noccurring at least 15 business days (within the meaning\nof section 51ABK) before the end of the phase 2\ndetermination period for the notification.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a person is the notifying party of a notification of an\nacquisition; and\n\n(b) a change of fact occurs; and\n\n(c) the change of fact is material to the Commission making a\ndetermination under subsection 51ABZE(1) in respect of the\nnotification; and\n\n(d) the person becomes aware of the change of fact at a time:\n\n(i) occurring on or after the effective notification date of\nthe notification; and\n\n(ii) at which the Commission has not decided to cease\nconsidering the notification under section 51ABZD; and\n\n(iii) at which the Commission has not made a determination\nin respect of the notification under\nsubsection 51ABZE(1); and\n\n(iv) if the notification is subject to phase 2 review—\noccurring at least 15 business days (within the meaning\nof section 51ABK) before the end of the phase 2\ndetermination period for the notification.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-1-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-1-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-1-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "45bffaa44780f70f2b6e73d2f65aaaa6a70f3c56e7d3ac5ab42fd9094f75ea24",
      "skos:note": "Commission must be notified of material changes of fact in respect of a notification."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45ax-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45AX(1) Commission must be notified of material changes of fact in",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 304,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a person is the notifying party of a notification of an\nacquisition; and\n\n(b) a change of fact occurs; and\n\n(c) the change of fact is material to the Commission making a\ndetermination under subsection 51ABZE(1) in respect of the\nnotification; and\n\n(d) the person becomes aware of the change of fact at a time:\n\n(i) occurring on or after the effective notification date of\nthe notification; and\n\n(ii) at which the Commission has not decided to cease\nconsidering the notification under section 51ABZD; and\n\n(iii) at which the Commission has not made a determination\nin respect of the notification under\nsubsection 51ABZE(1); and\n\n(iv) if the notification is subject to phase 2 review—\noccurring at least 15 business days (within the meaning\nof section 51ABK) before the end of the phase 2\ndetermination period for the notification."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-1-norm",
