        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(i) occurring on or after the effective notification date of the notification; and (ii) at which the Commission has not decided to cease considering the notification under section 51ABZD;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-1-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must notify the Commission within a timeframe",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(iii) at which the Commission has not made a determination in respect of the notification under subsection 51ABZE(1); and (iv) if the notification is subject to phase 2 review—occurring at least 15 business days (within the meaning of section 51ABK) before the end of the phase 2 determination period for the notification.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person must notify the Commission within a timeframe."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Applicable",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Conditional obligation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(i) occurring on or after the effective notification date of the notification; and (ii) at which the Commission has not decided to cease considering the notification under section 51ABZD;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-1-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Applicable",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Conditional obligation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(iii) at which the Commission has not made a determination in respect of the notification under subsection 51ABZE(1); and (iv) if the notification is subject to phase 2 review—occurring at least 15 business days (within the meaning of section 51ABK) before the end of the phase 2 determination period for the notification."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45AX(2) Commission must be notified of material changes of fact in",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45ax-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.304",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this section, the person is taken to become\naware of the change of fact at the earliest time at which the person\nis:\n\n(a) aware of the change of fact; and\n\n(b) aware that the change of fact is material in the way described\nin paragraph (1)(c).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this section, the person is taken to become\naware of the change of fact at the earliest time at which the person\nis:\n\n(a) aware of the change of fact; and\n\n(b) aware that the change of fact is material in the way described\nin paragraph (1)(c).",
