    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45AX(3) Commission must be notified of material changes of fact in",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45ax-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.304",
      "values:originalText": "(3) This section also applies if:\n\n(a) a person is the notifying party of a notification of an\nacquisition; and\n\n(b) the notifying party has made a public benefit application in\nrelation to the notification; and\n\n(c) a change of fact occurs; and\n\nRestrictive trade practices  Chapter 3\nRestrictive trade practices  Part IV\nAcquisitions  Division 1A\n\nSection 45AY\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(d) the change of fact is material to the Commission making a\ndetermination under subsection 51ABZW(1) in respect of the\napplication; and\n\n(e) the person becomes aware of the change of fact at a time:\n\n(i) occurring on or after the effective application date of the\napplication; and\n\n(ii) at which the Commission has not decided to cease\nconsidering the application under section 51ABZV; and\n\n(iii) at which the Commission has not made a determination\nunder subsection 51ABZW(1) in respect of the\napplication.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) This section also applies if:\n\n(a) a person is the notifying party of a notification of an\nacquisition; and\n\n(b) the notifying party has made a public benefit application in\nrelation to the notification; and\n\n(c) a change of fact occurs; and\n\nRestrictive trade practices  Chapter 3\nRestrictive trade practices  Part IV\nAcquisitions  Division 1A\n\nSection 45AY\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(d) the change of fact is material to the Commission making a\ndetermination under subsection 51ABZW(1) in respect of the\napplication; and\n\n(e) the person becomes aware of the change of fact at a time:\n\n(i) occurring on or after the effective application date of the\napplication; and\n\n(ii) at which the Commission has not decided to cease\nconsidering the application under section 51ABZV; and\n\n(iii) at which the Commission has not made a determination\nunder subsection 51ABZW(1) in respect of the\napplication.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c33787020869a6e609d9470f90d7df09ba0f5801c7b54bae841f6c2a9b87e66d",
      "skos:note": "Commission must be notified of material changes of fact in relation to a public benefit application."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45ax-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45AX(3) Commission must be notified of material changes of fact in",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 304,
      "values:originalText": "(3) This section also applies if:\n\n(a) a person is the notifying party of a notification of an\nacquisition; and\n\n(b) the notifying party has made a public benefit application in\nrelation to the notification; and\n\n(c) a change of fact occurs; and\n\nRestrictive trade practices  Chapter 3\nRestrictive trade practices  Part IV\nAcquisitions  Division 1A\n\nSection 45AY\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(d) the change of fact is material to the Commission making a\ndetermination under subsection 51ABZW(1) in respect of the\napplication; and\n\n(e) the person becomes aware of the change of fact at a time:\n\n(i) occurring on or after the effective application date of the\napplication; and\n\n(ii) at which the Commission has not decided to cease\nconsidering the application under section 51ABZV; and\n\n(iii) at which the Commission has not made a determination\nunder subsection 51ABZW(1) in respect of the\napplication."
    },
