    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45AX(5) Commission must be notified of material changes of fact in",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45ax-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.304",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The person contravenes this subsection if the Commission is not\nnotified of the change of fact, as soon as practicable after the\nperson becomes aware of the change, by:\n\n(a) if the person is the only notifying party of the notification of\nthe acquisition—the person; or\n\n(b) otherwise—all of the notifying parties jointly.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see Part VI.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The person contravenes this subsection if the Commission is not\nnotified of the change of fact, as soon as practicable after the\nperson becomes aware of the change, by:\n\n(a) if the person is the only notifying party of the notification of\nthe acquisition—the person; or\n\n(b) otherwise—all of the notifying parties jointly.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see Part VI.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45ax-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d6295ba370e210a670794def12f714127a22d5158c4d32c9798ba526a3cd9b6a",
      "skos:note": "Notify Commission of material changes of fact",
      "dc:description": "Notification to Commission"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45ax-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45AX(5) Commission must be notified of material changes of fact in",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 304,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The person contravenes this subsection if the Commission is not\nnotified of the change of fact, as soon as practicable after the\nperson becomes aware of the change, by:\n\n(a) if the person is the only notifying party of the notification of\nthe acquisition—the person; or\n\n(b) otherwise—all of the notifying parties jointly.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see Part VI."
    },
    {
