      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.306",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to an acquisition that is put into effect, or\npurportedly put into effect, in contravention of section 45AY.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to an acquisition that is put into effect, or\npurportedly put into effect, in contravention of section 45AY.",
      "values:partOf": {
