    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45az-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45AZ(2) Conditions must be complied with",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45az-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.306",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The acquisition is, and is taken always to have been, void by force\nof this subsection.\nSubdivision D—Miscellaneous\n45AZB  Providing false or misleading information\n\nA person contravenes this section if:\n\n(a) the person gives information to the Commission or the\nTribunal under an acquisitions provision; and\n\n(b) the information is false or misleading in a material particular;\nand\n\n(c) the person knows that, or is reckless as to whether, the\ninformation is false or misleading in a material particular.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see Part VI.\n\nRestrictive trade practices  Chapter 3\nRestrictive trade practices  Part IV\nOther provisions  Division 2\n\nSection 45\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The acquisition is, and is taken always to have been, void by force\nof this subsection.\nSubdivision D—Miscellaneous\n45AZB  Providing false or misleading information\n\nA person contravenes this section if:\n\n(a) the person gives information to the Commission or the\nTribunal under an acquisitions provision; and\n\n(b) the information is false or misleading in a material particular;\nand\n\n(c) the person knows that, or is reckless as to whether, the\ninformation is false or misleading in a material particular.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see Part VI.\n\nRestrictive trade practices  Chapter 3\nRestrictive trade practices  Part IV\nOther provisions  Division 2\n\nSection 45\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45az"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45az-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45az-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45az-ss-2-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "25979b0dd0c43927e4b3ad41f00bd6b807d0c5c4b51da8138f18e49ab69feac2",
      "skos:note": "Providing false or misleading information is prohibited. Failure to comply with conditions is a contravention."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45az-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45AZ(2) Conditions must be complied with",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 306,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The acquisition is, and is taken always to have been, void by force\nof this subsection.\nSubdivision D—Miscellaneous\n45AZB  Providing false or misleading information\n\nA person contravenes this section if:\n\n(a) the person gives information to the Commission or the\nTribunal under an acquisitions provision; and\n\n(b) the information is false or misleading in a material particular;\nand\n\n(c) the person knows that, or is reckless as to whether, the\ninformation is false or misleading in a material particular.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see Part VI.\n\nRestrictive trade practices  Chapter 3\nRestrictive trade practices  Part IV\nOther provisions  Division 2\n\nSection 45\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
