    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45(3) Contracts, arrangements or understandings that restrict dealings",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-45-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.307",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this section, competition means:\n\n(a) in relation to a provision of a contract, arrangement or\nunderstanding or of a proposed contract, arrangement or\nunderstanding—competition in any market in which:\n\n(i) a corporation that is a party to the contract, arrangement\nor understanding, or would be a party to the proposed\ncontract, arrangement or understanding; or\n\n(ii) any body corporate related to such a corporation;\n\nsupplies or acquires, or is likely to supply or acquire, goods\nor services or would, but for the provision, supply or acquire,\nor be likely to supply or acquire, goods or services; or\n\n(b) in relation to a concerted practice—competition in any\nmarket in which:\n\nChapter 3  Restrictive trade practices",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of this section, competition means:\n\n(a) in relation to a provision of a contract, arrangement or\nunderstanding or of a proposed contract, arrangement or\nunderstanding—competition in any market in which:\n\n(i) a corporation that is a party to the contract, arrangement\nor understanding, or would be a party to the proposed\ncontract, arrangement or understanding; or\n\n(ii) any body corporate related to such a corporation;\n\nsupplies or acquires, or is likely to supply or acquire, goods\nor services or would, but for the provision, supply or acquire,\nor be likely to supply or acquire, goods or services; or\n\n(b) in relation to a concerted practice—competition in any\nmarket in which:\n\nChapter 3  Restrictive trade practices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-45-ss-3-norm"
        },
