    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-46b-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "46B(1) No immunity from jurisdiction in relation to certain New",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 328,
      "values:originalText": "(1) It is hereby declared, for the avoidance of doubt, that the\nCommonwealth, the States, the Australian Capital Territory and the\nNorthern Territory, and their authorities, are not immune, and may\nnot claim immunity, from the jurisdiction of the courts of Australia\nand New Zealand in relation to matters arising under sections 36A,\n98H and 99A of the Commerce Act 1986 of New Zealand."
    },
