    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-48",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "48 Resale price maintenance",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-48"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.334",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A corporation or other person shall not engage in the practice of\nresale price maintenance.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not apply to a corporation or other person\nengaging in conduct that constitutes the practice of resale price\nmaintenance if:\n\nRestrictive trade practices  Chapter 3\nRestrictive trade practices  Part IV\nOther provisions  Division 2\n\nSection 49\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) the corporation or other person has given the Commission a\nnotice under subsection 93(1) describing the conduct; and\n\n(b) the notice is in force under section 93.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A corporation or other person shall not engage in the practice of\nresale price maintenance.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not apply to a corporation or other person\nengaging in conduct that constitutes the practice of resale price\nmaintenance if:\n\nRestrictive trade practices  Chapter 3\nRestrictive trade practices  Part IV\nOther provisions  Division 2\n\nSection 49\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) the corporation or other person has given the Commission a\nnotice under subsection 93(1) describing the conduct; and\n\n(b) the notice is in force under section 93.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-48-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-48-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d762eceed760020f17fe014aa49a18374bdf94328af1d3f62bdde303356ce78b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-48",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "48 Resale price maintenance",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 334,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A corporation or other person shall not engage in the practice of\nresale price maintenance.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not apply to a corporation or other person\nengaging in conduct that constitutes the practice of resale price\nmaintenance if:\n\nRestrictive trade practices  Chapter 3\nRestrictive trade practices  Part IV\nOther provisions  Division 2\n\nSection 49\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(a) the corporation or other person has given the Commission a\nnotice under subsection 93(1) describing the conduct; and\n\n(b) the notice is in force under section 93."
    },
