    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-51ae-ss-1c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "51AE(1C) Regulations relating to industry codes",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-51ae-ss-1c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.440",
      "values:originalText": "(1C) If an industry code prescribed by the regulations confers on a\nperson or body a function or power in relation to the code, the code\nmay provide that the function or power is to be exercised by\nlegislative instrument or other kind of written instrument.",
      "skos:definition": "(1C) If an industry code prescribed by the regulations confers on a\nperson or body a function or power in relation to the code, the code\nmay provide that the function or power is to be exercised by\nlegislative instrument or other kind of written instrument.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-51ae"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-51ae-ss-1c-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8223e169238b95594bac3f46e4458e7b6cffbdceaed308d75cf3884cc976a615",
      "skos:note": "Code may provide for exercise of function or power through written instrument"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-51ae-ss-1c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "51AE(1C) Regulations relating to industry codes",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 440,
      "values:originalText": "(1C) If an industry code prescribed by the regulations confers on a\nperson or body a function or power in relation to the code, the code\nmay provide that the function or power is to be exercised by\nlegislative instrument or other kind of written instrument."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-51ae-ss-1c-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-51ae-ss-1c"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-51ae-ss-1d",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "51AE(1D) Regulations relating to industry codes",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-51ae-ss-1d"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.440",
      "values:originalText": "(1D) However, if an industry code confers on a person or body a\nfunction of providing, or a power to provide, exemptions from the\ncode or specified provisions of the code, then (despite anything to\nthe contrary in the code):\n\n(a) the function or power must be exercised by written\ninstrument (an exemption instrument); and\n\n(b) if the code does not provide that an exemption instrument\nmade under the code is a legislative instrument, then:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(1D) However, if an industry code confers on a person or body a\nfunction of providing, or a power to provide, exemptions from the\ncode or specified provisions of the code, then (despite anything to\nthe contrary in the code):\n\n(a) the function or power must be exercised by written\ninstrument (an exemption instrument); and\n\n(b) if the code does not provide that an exemption instrument\nmade under the code is a legislative instrument, then:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-51ae"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-51ae-ss-1d-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-51ae-ss-1d-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "557b233d52b1db5f2ce21e29ce7f8732457acee492f9570d3edd2648457a9660",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions from industry codes must be exercised through written instruments.",
      "dc:description": "Written instrument (exemption instrument)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-51ae-ss-1d",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "51AE(1D) Regulations relating to industry codes",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 440,
      "values:originalText": "(1D) However, if an industry code confers on a person or body a\nfunction of providing, or a power to provide, exemptions from the\ncode or specified provisions of the code, then (despite anything to\nthe contrary in the code):\n\n(a) the function or power must be exercised by written\ninstrument (an exemption instrument); and\n\n(b) if the code does not provide that an exemption instrument\nmade under the code is a legislative instrument, then:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc."
    },
