    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-51af",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "51AF Acquisition of property",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-51af"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.444",
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies to the following provisions:\n\n(a) paragraphs 51AE(1A)(b) and (c);\n\n(b) a provision of an industry code prescribed for the purposes of\nthis Part that is authorised by paragraph 51AE(1A)(b) or (c);\n\n(c) any other provision of this Act or the regulations, to the\nextent to which the provision relates to a provision\nmentioned in paragraph (a) or (b) of this subsection.\nEffect of provisions\n\n(2) The provisions have no effect to the extent (if any) to which their\noperation would result in the acquisition of property (within the\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nIndustry codes  Part IVB\nMiscellaneous  Division 6\n\nSection 51AF\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nmeaning of paragraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution) otherwise than\non just terms (within the meaning of that paragraph).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code",
      "skos:definition": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies to the following provisions:\n\n(a) paragraphs 51AE(1A)(b) and (c);\n\n(b) a provision of an industry code prescribed for the purposes of\nthis Part that is authorised by paragraph 51AE(1A)(b) or (c);\n\n(c) any other provision of this Act or the regulations, to the\nextent to which the provision relates to a provision\nmentioned in paragraph (a) or (b) of this subsection.\nEffect of provisions\n\n(2) The provisions have no effect to the extent (if any) to which their\noperation would result in the acquisition of property (within the\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nIndustry codes  Part IVB\nMiscellaneous  Division 6\n\nSection 51AF\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nmeaning of paragraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution) otherwise than\non just terms (within the meaning of that paragraph).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-51af-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-51af-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-51af",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "51AF Acquisition of property",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 444,
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies to the following provisions:\n\n(a) paragraphs 51AE(1A)(b) and (c);\n\n(b) a provision of an industry code prescribed for the purposes of\nthis Part that is authorised by paragraph 51AE(1A)(b) or (c);\n\n(c) any other provision of this Act or the regulations, to the\nextent to which the provision relates to a provision\nmentioned in paragraph (a) or (b) of this subsection.\nEffect of provisions\n\n(2) The provisions have no effect to the extent (if any) to which their\noperation would result in the acquisition of property (within the\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nIndustry codes  Part IVB\nMiscellaneous  Division 6\n\nSection 51AF\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nmeaning of paragraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution) otherwise than\non just terms (within the meaning of that paragraph).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code"
    },
