    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "52C Interacting with content",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.448",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a user of a service interacts with\ncontent made available by the service if:\n\n(a) the content is reproduced on the service, or is otherwise\nplaced on the service, and the user interacts with the content;\nor\n\n(b) a link to the content is provided on the service and the user\ninteracts with the link; or\n\n(c) an extract of the content is provided on the service and the\nuser interacts with the extract.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not limit, for the purposes of this Part, the\nways in which a user of a service interacts with content made\navailable by a service.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nNews media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code  Part IVBA\nBasic concepts  Division 1\n\nSection 52D\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a user of a service interacts with\ncontent made available by the service if:\n\n(a) the content is reproduced on the service, or is otherwise\nplaced on the service, and the user interacts with the content;\nor\n\n(b) a link to the content is provided on the service and the user\ninteracts with the link; or\n\n(c) an extract of the content is provided on the service and the\nuser interacts with the extract.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not limit, for the purposes of this Part, the\nways in which a user of a service interacts with content made\navailable by a service.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nNews media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code  Part IVBA\nBasic concepts  Division 1\n\nSection 52D\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52c-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52c-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b1eb21d944fbcf16e5f039d3b2b3972127cbce04855c12ddcdcc69e622a72847"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52C Interacting with content",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 448,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a user of a service interacts with\ncontent made available by the service if:\n\n(a) the content is reproduced on the service, or is otherwise\nplaced on the service, and the user interacts with the content;\nor\n\n(b) a link to the content is provided on the service and the user\ninteracts with the link; or\n\n(c) an extract of the content is provided on the service and the\nuser interacts with the extract.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not limit, for the purposes of this Part, the\nways in which a user of a service interacts with content made\navailable by a service.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nNews media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code  Part IVBA\nBasic concepts  Division 1\n\nSection 52D\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
