      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.453",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the ACMA considers that the requirement in subsection (2) is\nmet, the ACMA must:\n\n(a) if the news business is not already a registered news\nbusiness—register the news business; and\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If the ACMA considers that the requirement in subsection (2) is\nmet, the ACMA must:\n\n(a) if the news business is not already a registered news\nbusiness—register the news business; and\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code",
