    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52q",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "52Q Obligations in respect of digital platform services individually",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52q"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.461",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The provisions of Subdivisions B and C create obligations in\nrespect of every designated digital platform service, in respect of\neach registered news business.\n\n(2) Those obligations are placed on the responsible digital platform\ncorporation for the designated digital platform service, in respect of\nthe registered news business corporation for the registered news\nbusiness.\n\n(3) If there is more than one responsible digital platform corporation\nfor the designated digital platform service:\n\n(a) those obligations are placed on each of those responsible\ndigital platform corporations separately; and\n\n(b) treat references in Subdivision B and C to the responsible\ndigital platform corporation for the designated digital\nplatform service as being references to each responsible\ndigital platform corporation for the designated digital\nplatform service.\nSubdivision B—The minimum standards",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The provisions of Subdivisions B and C create obligations in\nrespect of every designated digital platform service, in respect of\neach registered news business.\n\n(2) Those obligations are placed on the responsible digital platform\ncorporation for the designated digital platform service, in respect of\nthe registered news business corporation for the registered news\nbusiness.\n\n(3) If there is more than one responsible digital platform corporation\nfor the designated digital platform service:\n\n(a) those obligations are placed on each of those responsible\ndigital platform corporations separately; and\n\n(b) treat references in Subdivision B and C to the responsible\ndigital platform corporation for the designated digital\nplatform service as being references to each responsible\ndigital platform corporation for the designated digital\nplatform service.\nSubdivision B—The minimum standards",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52q-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52q-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52q-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9f5fcf5d8ee159d788c073bc6ef923f8451e156614eff37a41796c2bf4427fd6"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52q",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52Q Obligations in respect of digital platform services individually",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 461,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The provisions of Subdivisions B and C create obligations in\nrespect of every designated digital platform service, in respect of\neach registered news business.\n\n(2) Those obligations are placed on the responsible digital platform\ncorporation for the designated digital platform service, in respect of\nthe registered news business corporation for the registered news\nbusiness.\n\n(3) If there is more than one responsible digital platform corporation\nfor the designated digital platform service:\n\n(a) those obligations are placed on each of those responsible\ndigital platform corporations separately; and\n\n(b) treat references in Subdivision B and C to the responsible\ndigital platform corporation for the designated digital\nplatform service as being references to each responsible\ndigital platform corporation for the designated digital\nplatform service.\nSubdivision B—The minimum standards"
    },
