    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zf",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "52ZF Application of Subdivision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52zf"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.473",
      "values:originalText": "This Subdivision applies if a notification is made for the purposes\nof subsection 52ZE(1).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code",
      "skos:definition": "This Subdivision applies if a notification is made for the purposes\nof subsection 52ZE(1).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zf-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "587e867b441e55d317466da6e63a9cf44e48ce2351e87d80def1efe986b56ff5",
      "skos:note": "Notification requirement for subsection 52ZE(1) applicability"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52zf",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52ZF Application of Subdivision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 473,
      "values:originalText": "This Subdivision applies if a notification is made for the purposes\nof subsection 52ZE(1).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zf-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zf"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zg",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "52ZG Bargaining parties, core bargaining issues and represented",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52zg"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.474",
      "values:originalText": "registered news businesses\n\n(1) The bargaining parties are as follows:\n\n(a) the bargaining news business representative that made the\nnotification;\n\n(b) the responsible digital platform corporation for the\ndesignated digital platform service to which the notification\nrelates.\n\n(2) The bargaining parties may agree, in writing, that they wish to\nbargain over one or more extra specified issues relating to the\nregistered news business’ covered news content made available by\nany of the following:\n\n(a) the designated digital platform service;\n\n(b) specified services other than the designated digital platform\nservice.\n\n(3) The core bargaining issues are:\n\n(a) the specified issues in the notification (as mentioned in\nparagraph 52ZE(4)(e)); and\n\n(a) the specified issues in an agreement (if any) between the\nbargaining parties as mentioned in subsection (2).\n\n(4) Each registered news business to which the notification relates is a\nrepresented registered news business.",
      "skos:definition": "registered news businesses\n\n(1) The bargaining parties are as follows:\n\n(a) the bargaining news business representative that made the\nnotification;\n\n(b) the responsible digital platform corporation for the\ndesignated digital platform service to which the notification\nrelates.\n\n(2) The bargaining parties may agree, in writing, that they wish to\nbargain over one or more extra specified issues relating to the\nregistered news business’ covered news content made available by\nany of the following:\n\n(a) the designated digital platform service;\n\n(b) specified services other than the designated digital platform\nservice.\n\n(3) The core bargaining issues are:\n\n(a) the specified issues in the notification (as mentioned in\nparagraph 52ZE(4)(e)); and\n\n(a) the specified issues in an agreement (if any) between the\nbargaining parties as mentioned in subsection (2).\n\n(4) Each registered news business to which the notification relates is a\nrepresented registered news business.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zg-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zg-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zg-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zg-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "48873e466e69771570a6214a0b53a6c26487deb83ffd99b85d12c0ff6a61ee61"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52zg",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52ZG Bargaining parties, core bargaining issues and represented",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 474,
      "values:originalText": "registered news businesses\n\n(1) The bargaining parties are as follows:\n\n(a) the bargaining news business representative that made the\nnotification;\n\n(b) the responsible digital platform corporation for the\ndesignated digital platform service to which the notification\nrelates.\n\n(2) The bargaining parties may agree, in writing, that they wish to\nbargain over one or more extra specified issues relating to the\nregistered news business’ covered news content made available by\nany of the following:\n\n(a) the designated digital platform service;\n\n(b) specified services other than the designated digital platform\nservice.\n\n(3) The core bargaining issues are:\n\n(a) the specified issues in the notification (as mentioned in\nparagraph 52ZE(4)(e)); and\n\n(a) the specified issues in an agreement (if any) between the\nbargaining parties as mentioned in subsection (2).\n\n(4) Each registered news business to which the notification relates is a\nrepresented registered news business."
    },
