      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zi-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "52ZI(4) Obligation to notify Commission if agreement reached",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52zi-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.474",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting the scope of regulations that may be made for the\npurposes of subsection (1), those regulations may:\n\n(a) set out rules relating to the payment of the costs of the\nmediator; and\n\n(b) without limiting the scope of paragraph (a), specify who is to\npay those costs.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Without limiting the scope of regulations that may be made for the\npurposes of subsection (1), those regulations may:\n\n(a) set out rules relating to the payment of the costs of the\nmediator; and\n\n(b) without limiting the scope of paragraph (a), specify who is to\npay those costs.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zi"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zi-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zi-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2fbef395caeae066e314d07d0af19498f403bc34651c7a8fcc257b63b7b443fa",
      "skos:note": "Mediator must be appointed by ACMA Notify Commission if agreement reached"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52zi-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52ZI(4) Obligation to notify Commission if agreement reached",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 474,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting the scope of regulations that may be made for the\npurposes of subsection (1), those regulations may:\n\n(a) set out rules relating to the payment of the costs of the\nmediator; and\n\n(b) without limiting the scope of paragraph (a), specify who is to\npay those costs.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code"
    },
