      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.478",
      "values:originalText": "(7) For the purposes of subsection (6), the notice must be given no\nlater than the end of:\n\n(a) the period of 10 business days after the notice was given\nunder subsection 52ZL(5); or\n\n(b) if regulations made for the purposes of this paragraph specify\na different period—that period.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) For the purposes of subsection (6), the notice must be given no\nlater than the end of:\n\n(a) the period of 10 business days after the notice was given\nunder subsection 52ZL(5); or\n\n(b) if regulations made for the purposes of this paragraph specify\na different period—that period.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zm"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zm-ss-7-norm"
        },
