      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.478",
      "values:originalText": "(9) The ACMA may only make an appointment of a person who is\nlisted on the register of bargaining code arbitrators.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code",
      "skos:definition": "(9) The ACMA may only make an appointment of a person who is\nlisted on the register of bargaining code arbitrators.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code",
