      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.480",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the ACMA has reason to consider that a person who has been\nappointed as a member of the panel has any actual or potential\nconflict of interest in relation to the arbitration (regardless whether\nthe person declared the conflict in accordance with subsection (2)):\n\n(a) the ACMA may give a notice in writing to the person stating\nthat the person should no longer be a member of the panel;\nand\n\n(b) the person ceases to be a member of the panel when ACMA\ngives the person the notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the ACMA has reason to consider that a person who has been\nappointed as a member of the panel has any actual or potential\nconflict of interest in relation to the arbitration (regardless whether\nthe person declared the conflict in accordance with subsection (2)):\n\n(a) the ACMA may give a notice in writing to the person stating\nthat the person should no longer be a member of the panel;\nand\n\n(b) the person ceases to be a member of the panel when ACMA\ngives the person the notice.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zn"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zn-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zn-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zn-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zn-ss-3-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zn-ss-3-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zn-ss-3-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4d73871f9bb76a3c96510d003cd452131e60a36d84624f4ffa334a25fcb2e642",
      "skos:note": "ACMA may remove a panel member with conflict of interest"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52zn-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52ZN(3) Disclosure of conflicts of interest where ACMA appoints",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 480,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the ACMA has reason to consider that a person who has been\nappointed as a member of the panel has any actual or potential\nconflict of interest in relation to the arbitration (regardless whether\nthe person declared the conflict in accordance with subsection (2)):\n\n(a) the ACMA may give a notice in writing to the person stating\nthat the person should no longer be a member of the panel;\nand\n\n(b) the person ceases to be a member of the panel when ACMA\ngives the person the notice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zn-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zn-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
