      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.480",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the ACMA gives a notice under paragraph (3)(a), the ACMA\nmust, as soon as practicable:\n\n(a) give a copy of the notice to the bargaining parties; and\n\n(b) make an appointment of another person as a member of the\npanel.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the ACMA gives a notice under paragraph (3)(a), the ACMA\nmust, as soon as practicable:\n\n(a) give a copy of the notice to the bargaining parties; and\n\n(b) make an appointment of another person as a member of the\npanel.",
      "values:partOf": {
