        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zn-ss-4-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "33ce7e6dd566396f883e5376c1ef51643eca051096c9fdabe587e87e903894f7",
      "skos:note": "ACMA must disclose conflicts of interest upon appointment",
      "dc:description": "yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52zn-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52ZN(4) Disclosure of conflicts of interest where ACMA appoints",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 480,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the ACMA gives a notice under paragraph (3)(a), the ACMA\nmust, as soon as practicable:\n\n(a) give a copy of the notice to the bargaining parties; and\n\n(b) make an appointment of another person as a member of the\npanel."
    },
    {
