    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zu-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "52ZU(6) Information request by bargaining party—challenges by",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52zu-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.484",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Nothing in section 52ZT requires the giving of information to the\nextent (if any) that the panel makes a ruling under subsection (3)\nthat it was not reasonable for the bargaining party to make the\nrequest for the purposes of this Division, in relation to all or a\nspecified part of the information requested.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Nothing in section 52ZT requires the giving of information to the\nextent (if any) that the panel makes a ruling under subsection (3)\nthat it was not reasonable for the bargaining party to make the\nrequest for the purposes of this Division, in relation to all or a\nspecified part of the information requested.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zu"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zu-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zu-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b2b9e6cf5bc8c2c2b91aa197dae8323e345b51cf86c3c1eec652358234f73e08",
      "skos:note": "No obligation to provide information beyond what is reasonable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52zu-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52ZU(6) Information request by bargaining party—challenges by",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 484,
      "values:originalText": "(6) Nothing in section 52ZT requires the giving of information to the\nextent (if any) that the panel makes a ruling under subsection (3)\nthat it was not reasonable for the bargaining party to make the\nrequest for the purposes of this Division, in relation to all or a\nspecified part of the information requested."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zu-ss-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
