      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.484",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Nothing in section 52ZT requires the giving of information the\ndisclosure of which would reveal a trade secret.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nNews media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code  Part IVBA\nArbitration about remuneration issue  Division 7\n\nSection 52ZW\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Nothing in section 52ZT requires the giving of information the\ndisclosure of which would reveal a trade secret.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nNews media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code  Part IVBA\nArbitration about remuneration issue  Division 7\n\nSection 52ZW\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zv"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zv-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-52zv-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c8ea8dbc8afbf487f25d76f41b1a203961c9794e956d632a05b2932c6301f140",
      "skos:note": "No information must be given that would reveal a trade secret."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52zv-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52ZV(1) Information request by bargaining party—miscellaneous",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 484,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Nothing in section 52ZT requires the giving of information the\ndisclosure of which would reveal a trade secret.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nNews media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code  Part IVBA\nArbitration about remuneration issue  Division 7\n\nSection 52ZW\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026"
    },
