      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.485",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The arbitration terminates in accordance with that agreement, but\nno earlier than the day on which parties notify the Chair of the\nagreement in accordance with subsection (2).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The arbitration terminates in accordance with that agreement, but\nno earlier than the day on which parties notify the Chair of the\nagreement in accordance with subsection (2).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code",
      "values:partOf": {
