      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.486",
      "values:originalText": "(5) An offer that does not comply with subsection (4) is not a final\noffer for the purposes of this Division.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) An offer that does not comply with subsection (4) is not a final\noffer for the purposes of this Division.",
      "values:partOf": {
