      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.486",
      "values:originalText": "(8) If the panel does not accept one of those final offers, it must\nascertain the remuneration amount by adjusting the most\nreasonable of those offers in a manner that results in that offer\nbeing in the public interest.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) If the panel does not accept one of those final offers, it must\nascertain the remuneration amount by adjusting the most\nreasonable of those offers in a manner that results in that offer\nbeing in the public interest.",
