      "cml:integrityHash": "184825c169e2556a04073e76825a93e5492ef23e20cf56bc6a93478910710db1",
      "skos:note": "Panel must make determination within 35 business days after latest submission deadline Panel must consider certain matters when making a determination under subsection 52ZX(1)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-52zy-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52ZY(1) Final offer arbitration—termination of arbitration if no final",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 488,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The panel must make the determination no later than 35 business\ndays (or, if the regulations specify a different period, the end of\nthat period) after the latest of the following days:\n\n(a) the last day on which a final offer may be submitted in\naccordance with subsection 52ZX(4);\n\n(b) the last day on which a submission may be given by a\nbargaining party in accordance with subsection 52ZZB(1);\n\n(c) the last day on which a submission may be given by the\nCommission in accordance with subsection 52ZZC(1);\n\n(d) the last day on which a submission may be given by a\nbargaining party in accordance with subsection 52ZZC(3).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBA  News media and digital platforms mandatory bargaining code"
    },
