      "cml:conclusionText": "constitutional corporation is a subclass of corporation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53C Gas market conduct",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.509",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, gas market conduct is:\n\n(a) conduct relating to supplying or acquiring a gas commodity,\nor to the potential supply or acquisition of a gas commodity;\nor\n\n(b) without limiting paragraph (a)—any of the following:\n\n(i) supplying or acquiring a gas commodity;\n\n(ii) issuing or receiving an expression of interest in relation\nto supplying or acquiring a gas commodity;\n\n(iii) responding to an expression of interest in relation to\nsupplying or acquiring a gas commodity;\n\n(iv) offering to supply or acquire a gas commodity, or\nreceiving such an offer;\n\n(v) responding to an offer to supply or acquire a gas\ncommodity;\n\n(vi) agreeing to supply or acquire a gas commodity;\n\n(vii) refusing to do anything mentioned in subparagraphs (i)\nto (vi);\n\n(viii) operating a gas exchange;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, gas market conduct is:\n\n(a) conduct relating to supplying or acquiring a gas commodity,\nor to the potential supply or acquisition of a gas commodity;\nor\n\n(b) without limiting paragraph (a)—any of the following:\n\n(i) supplying or acquiring a gas commodity;\n\n(ii) issuing or receiving an expression of interest in relation\nto supplying or acquiring a gas commodity;\n\n(iii) responding to an expression of interest in relation to\nsupplying or acquiring a gas commodity;\n\n(iv) offering to supply or acquire a gas commodity, or\nreceiving such an offer;\n\n(v) responding to an offer to supply or acquire a gas\ncommodity;\n\n(vi) agreeing to supply or acquire a gas commodity;\n\n(vii) refusing to do anything mentioned in subparagraphs (i)\nto (vi);\n\n(viii) operating a gas exchange;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53c-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53c-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4e8935bef82bca8b8a58edf3df4fa9cae98e212ad4acb90b5c04a596681764ad",
      "skos:note": "Defines gas market conduct"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53C Gas market conduct",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 509,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, gas market conduct is:\n\n(a) conduct relating to supplying or acquiring a gas commodity,\nor to the potential supply or acquisition of a gas commodity;\nor\n\n(b) without limiting paragraph (a)—any of the following:\n\n(i) supplying or acquiring a gas commodity;\n\n(ii) issuing or receiving an expression of interest in relation\nto supplying or acquiring a gas commodity;\n\n(iii) responding to an expression of interest in relation to\nsupplying or acquiring a gas commodity;\n\n(iv) offering to supply or acquire a gas commodity, or\nreceiving such an offer;\n\n(v) responding to an offer to supply or acquire a gas\ncommodity;\n\n(vi) agreeing to supply or acquire a gas commodity;\n\n(vii) refusing to do anything mentioned in subparagraphs (i)\nto (vi);\n\n(viii) operating a gas exchange;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53c-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53c"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53c-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Includes various actions related to supplying or acquiring a gas commodity",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53d",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53D Gas market participants",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53d"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.510",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a gas market participant is any of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) a person who engages, or is capable of engaging, in gas\nmarket conduct;\n\n(b) a person who has previously been a gas market participant\nunder paragraph (a), (c) or (d);\n\n(c) a body corporate that is related to a body corporate that is a\ngas market participant;\n\n(d) any of the persons who carry on a joint venture, if:\n\n(i) subparagraph 4J(a)(i) applies to the joint venture; and\n\n(ii) the joint venture is, or includes, gas market conduct;\n\n(e) a person or body prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph.\nNote:\nFor the meaning of related, see section 4A.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 53E\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, a person or body prescribed by the\nregulations for the purposes of this subsection is not a gas market\nparticipant.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) has effect subject to subsection (2).\nSubdivision C—Geographical application",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a gas market participant is any of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) a person who engages, or is capable of engaging, in gas\nmarket conduct;\n\n(b) a person who has previously been a gas market participant\nunder paragraph (a), (c) or (d);\n\n(c) a body corporate that is related to a body corporate that is a\ngas market participant;\n\n(d) any of the persons who carry on a joint venture, if:\n\n(i) subparagraph 4J(a)(i) applies to the joint venture; and\n\n(ii) the joint venture is, or includes, gas market conduct;\n\n(e) a person or body prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph.\nNote:\nFor the meaning of related, see section 4A.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 53E\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, a person or body prescribed by the\nregulations for the purposes of this subsection is not a gas market\nparticipant.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) has effect subject to subsection (2).\nSubdivision C—Geographical application",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53d-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53d-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53d-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f2fa0d657080c81a8c1b42dedbe8ec77e19f7350150d7328e06cdd27502a54e8"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53d",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53D Gas market participants",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 510,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a gas market participant is any of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) a person who engages, or is capable of engaging, in gas\nmarket conduct;\n\n(b) a person who has previously been a gas market participant\nunder paragraph (a), (c) or (d);\n\n(c) a body corporate that is related to a body corporate that is a\ngas market participant;\n\n(d) any of the persons who carry on a joint venture, if:\n\n(i) subparagraph 4J(a)(i) applies to the joint venture; and\n\n(ii) the joint venture is, or includes, gas market conduct;\n\n(e) a person or body prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph.\nNote:\nFor the meaning of related, see section 4A.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 53E\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, a person or body prescribed by the\nregulations for the purposes of this subsection is not a gas market\nparticipant.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) has effect subject to subsection (2).\nSubdivision C—Geographical application"
    },
