      "values:originalText": "(1) The gas market provisions apply in relation to supplying a gas\ncommodity if the supply:\n\n(a) occurs in Australia; or\n\n(b) is:\n\n(i) to a person in Australia, including by means of\nimporting the gas commodity into Australia; or\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The gas market provisions apply in relation to supplying a gas\ncommodity if the supply:\n\n(a) occurs in Australia; or\n\n(b) is:\n\n(i) to a person in Australia, including by means of\nimporting the gas commodity into Australia; or\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "cml:asserts": [
