      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.512",
      "values:originalText": "(2) To avoid doubt, this section does not limit the ability of a gas\nmarket instrument to limit the application of:\n\n(a) the instrument; or\n\n(b) a provision of the instrument; or\n\n(c) a rule included in the instrument;\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 53K\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nin relation to an entity covered by subsection (3) or (4).\nCommonwealth government entities",
      "skos:definition": "(2) To avoid doubt, this section does not limit the ability of a gas\nmarket instrument to limit the application of:\n\n(a) the instrument; or\n\n(b) a provision of the instrument; or\n\n(c) a rule included in the instrument;\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 53K\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nin relation to an entity covered by subsection (3) or (4).\nCommonwealth government entities",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53k"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53k-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "33ac1c0a2c3fe3e88d99d5f7c5fa75a05b6891c558ec5ccee38bb06668fe52eb",
      "skos:note": "Does not limit the ability of a gas market instrument to limit its application in relation to an entity covered by subsection (3) or (4)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53k-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53K(2) Application to government entities",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 512,
      "values:originalText": "(2) To avoid doubt, this section does not limit the ability of a gas\nmarket instrument to limit the application of:\n\n(a) the instrument; or\n\n(b) a provision of the instrument; or\n\n(c) a rule included in the instrument;\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 53K\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nin relation to an entity covered by subsection (3) or (4).\nCommonwealth government entities"
    },
