      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.514",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The regulations may prescribe matters required or permitted by this\nAct to be prescribed by a gas market code.\nNote:\nFor the matters that may be included in a gas market code, see\nSubdivisions B and D and subsection 53ZJ(1).\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) does not limit section 172 (power to\nmake regulations).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The regulations may prescribe matters required or permitted by this\nAct to be prescribed by a gas market code.\nNote:\nFor the matters that may be included in a gas market code, see\nSubdivisions B and D and subsection 53ZJ(1).\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) does not limit section 172 (power to\nmake regulations).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
