    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53m-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53M(8) Minister may make gas market emergency price orders",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53m-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.514",
      "values:originalText": "(8) For the purposes of subsections (6) and (7), the time is the time\noccurring:\n\n(a) if any provision of any gas market emergency price order\ncommences during the 12 months starting on the\ncommencement of this section—12 months after the earliest\ntime any provision of any gas market emergency price order\ncommences; or\n\n(b) otherwise—12 months after the commencement of this\nsection.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) For the purposes of subsections (6) and (7), the time is the time\noccurring:\n\n(a) if any provision of any gas market emergency price order\ncommences during the 12 months starting on the\ncommencement of this section—12 months after the earliest\ntime any provision of any gas market emergency price order\ncommences; or\n\n(b) otherwise—12 months after the commencement of this\nsection.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53m"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53m-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53m-ss-8-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "06cf2af922311a0027bb84c1aad826be1c6527b42ecac4d0822a07b3679e6793",
      "skos:note": "Defines time for gas market emergency price orders"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53m-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53M(8) Minister may make gas market emergency price orders",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 514,
      "values:originalText": "(8) For the purposes of subsections (6) and (7), the time is the time\noccurring:\n\n(a) if any provision of any gas market emergency price order\ncommences during the 12 months starting on the\ncommencement of this section—12 months after the earliest\ntime any provision of any gas market emergency price order\ncommences; or\n\n(b) otherwise—12 months after the commencement of this\nsection."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53m-ss-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53m-ss-8"
