      },
      "cml:operator": "Limitation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Limits the application of a gas market instrument or its provisions.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53p",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53P General",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53p"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.517",
      "values:originalText": "A gas market code may include rules regulating gas market\nconduct.\nNote:\nThe other provisions of this Subdivision and Subdivision D do not\nlimit this section: see section 53ZF.",
      "skos:definition": "A gas market code may include rules regulating gas market\nconduct.\nNote:\nThe other provisions of this Subdivision and Subdivision D do not\nlimit this section: see section 53ZF.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53p-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53p-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "953680ed028fe93e7137cfd794aa84896b0875c8997903e9f954fbd56ea76c7a",
      "skos:note": "Rules regulating gas market conduct may be included in a gas market code."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53p",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53P General",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 517,
      "values:originalText": "A gas market code may include rules regulating gas market\nconduct.\nNote:\nThe other provisions of this Subdivision and Subdivision D do not\nlimit this section: see section 53ZF."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53p-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53p"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53p-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Regulating conduct is an obligation.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53q",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53Q Dealing with other gas market participants",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53q"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.517",
      "values:originalText": "A gas market code may include any of the following rules in\nrelation to a gas market participant dealing with another gas market\nparticipant, if the dealing is or relates to gas market conduct:\n\n(a) rules about how a gas market participant deals with another\ngas market participant;\n\n(b) rules requiring a gas market participant to deal with another\ngas market participant in a specified manner, including in\ngood faith;\n\n(c) rules about the matters that, for the purposes of a gas market\ncode, must, may or must not be taken into account in\ndetermining whether a gas market participant is dealing with\nanother gas market participant in good faith;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "A gas market code may include any of the following rules in\nrelation to a gas market participant dealing with another gas market\nparticipant, if the dealing is or relates to gas market conduct:\n\n(a) rules about how a gas market participant deals with another\ngas market participant;\n\n(b) rules requiring a gas market participant to deal with another\ngas market participant in a specified manner, including in\ngood faith;\n\n(c) rules about the matters that, for the purposes of a gas market\ncode, must, may or must not be taken into account in\ndetermining whether a gas market participant is dealing with\nanother gas market participant in good faith;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53q-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53q-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "80db31906fb5809536f64602f3b3b07c4b8c7a6a3a1e5887ee2e57d68bb8c1a5",
      "skos:note": "Rules for dealing with other gas market participants in good faith"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53q",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53Q Dealing with other gas market participants",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 517,
      "values:originalText": "A gas market code may include any of the following rules in\nrelation to a gas market participant dealing with another gas market\nparticipant, if the dealing is or relates to gas market conduct:\n\n(a) rules about how a gas market participant deals with another\ngas market participant;\n\n(b) rules requiring a gas market participant to deal with another\ngas market participant in a specified manner, including in\ngood faith;\n\n(c) rules about the matters that, for the purposes of a gas market\ncode, must, may or must not be taken into account in\ndetermining whether a gas market participant is dealing with\nanother gas market participant in good faith;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market"
    },
    {
