    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53s",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53S Agreements",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53s"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.519",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market code may include rules about agreements relating to\nsupplying or acquiring a gas commodity, including:\n\n(a) rules requiring a gas market participant to enter, or not to\nenter, into an agreement in specified circumstances; or\n\n(b) rules about any of the following matters:\n\n(i) the manner in which an agreement is made (for\nexample, in writing);\n\n(ii) matters dealt with in an agreement, including, in the\ncase of an agreement to supply or acquire a gas\ncommodity, the matters mentioned in subsection (2);\n\n(iii) withdrawing from or ending an agreement.\nExample: Rules requiring specified matters to be dealt with, or not dealt with, in\nan agreement.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A gas market code may include rules about agreements relating to\nsupplying or acquiring a gas commodity, including:\n\n(a) rules requiring a gas market participant to enter, or not to\nenter, into an agreement in specified circumstances; or\n\n(b) rules about any of the following matters:\n\n(i) the manner in which an agreement is made (for\nexample, in writing);\n\n(ii) matters dealt with in an agreement, including, in the\ncase of an agreement to supply or acquire a gas\ncommodity, the matters mentioned in subsection (2);\n\n(iii) withdrawing from or ending an agreement.\nExample: Rules requiring specified matters to be dealt with, or not dealt with, in\nan agreement.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53s-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53s-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "977ce377a7ea8fef76e126c11e1ef460d70a2e53207cc2e3ee864913430c9776",
      "skos:note": "Rules about agreements relating to supplying or acquiring a gas commodity"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53s",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53S Agreements",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 519,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market code may include rules about agreements relating to\nsupplying or acquiring a gas commodity, including:\n\n(a) rules requiring a gas market participant to enter, or not to\nenter, into an agreement in specified circumstances; or\n\n(b) rules about any of the following matters:\n\n(i) the manner in which an agreement is made (for\nexample, in writing);\n\n(ii) matters dealt with in an agreement, including, in the\ncase of an agreement to supply or acquire a gas\ncommodity, the matters mentioned in subsection (2);\n\n(iii) withdrawing from or ending an agreement.\nExample: Rules requiring specified matters to be dealt with, or not dealt with, in\nan agreement.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53s-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53s"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53s-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "requires",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Requires rules about agreements",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
