    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53t-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53T(3) Terms on which gas commodities are supplied or acquired,",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53t-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.520",
      "values:originalText": "(3) To avoid doubt, a gas market code may include rules requiring a\ngas market participant not to offer to supply or acquire, not to\nagree to supply or acquire or not to supply or acquire a gas\ncommodity if rules of the kind mentioned in subsection (1) or (2)\nare not complied with in relation to the offer, agreement, supply or\nacquisition.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) To avoid doubt, a gas market code may include rules requiring a\ngas market participant not to offer to supply or acquire, not to\nagree to supply or acquire or not to supply or acquire a gas\ncommodity if rules of the kind mentioned in subsection (1) or (2)\nare not complied with in relation to the offer, agreement, supply or\nacquisition.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53t"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53t-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53t-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9623745c57f6aae93677bcd94c77fa7775aef49ae0177467f4ecd455a8e79e89",
      "skos:note": "Do not offer to supply or acquire a gas commodity if rules are not complied with."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53t-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53T(3) Terms on which gas commodities are supplied or acquired,",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 520,
      "values:originalText": "(3) To avoid doubt, a gas market code may include rules requiring a\ngas market participant not to offer to supply or acquire, not to\nagree to supply or acquire or not to supply or acquire a gas\ncommodity if rules of the kind mentioned in subsection (1) or (2)\nare not complied with in relation to the offer, agreement, supply or\nacquisition."
    },
