    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53v",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53V Dispute and complaint resolution",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53v"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.521",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market code may include rules about disputes between gas\nmarket participants relating to gas market conduct, including:\n\n(a) disputes or complaints arising under, or in relation to, a gas\nmarket code; or\n\n(b) disputes arising during negotiations between gas market\nparticipants, including any of the following:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A gas market code may include rules about disputes between gas\nmarket participants relating to gas market conduct, including:\n\n(a) disputes or complaints arising under, or in relation to, a gas\nmarket code; or\n\n(b) disputes arising during negotiations between gas market\nparticipants, including any of the following:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53v-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "951acf3452eb0c63f7313fd3ccc2a0347d4e8f6e4e63c83f0cf4281ae6f81531",
      "skos:note": "Rules for dispute resolution in gas market codes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53v",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53V Dispute and complaint resolution",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 521,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market code may include rules about disputes between gas\nmarket participants relating to gas market conduct, including:\n\n(a) disputes or complaints arising under, or in relation to, a gas\nmarket code; or\n\n(b) disputes arising during negotiations between gas market\nparticipants, including any of the following:\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53v-norm",
