      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LinearLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "or",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Offers alternative rules for setting a price",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::linear",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53x-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53X(3) Terms on which gas commodities are supplied or acquired,",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53x-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.524",
      "values:originalText": "(3) To avoid doubt, a gas market emergency price order may include\nrules requiring a gas market participant not to offer to supply or\nacquire, not to agree to supply or acquire or not to supply or\nacquire a gas commodity if rules of the kind mentioned in\nsubsection (1) or (2) are not complied with in relation to the offer,\nagreement, supply or acquisition.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "(3) To avoid doubt, a gas market emergency price order may include\nrules requiring a gas market participant not to offer to supply or\nacquire, not to agree to supply or acquire or not to supply or\nacquire a gas commodity if rules of the kind mentioned in\nsubsection (1) or (2) are not complied with in relation to the offer,\nagreement, supply or acquisition.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53x"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53x-ss-3-norm"
