        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53x-ss-3-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8326c6394ec524eb3c2cc2323d737bdb4c834aec47f042c1296ecf655fcadcdd",
      "skos:note": "Prohibition on offering to supply or acquire gas commodity if rules are not complied with"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53x-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53X(3) Terms on which gas commodities are supplied or acquired,",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 524,
      "values:originalText": "(3) To avoid doubt, a gas market emergency price order may include\nrules requiring a gas market participant not to offer to supply or\nacquire, not to agree to supply or acquire or not to supply or\nacquire a gas commodity if rules of the kind mentioned in\nsubsection (1) or (2) are not complied with in relation to the offer,\nagreement, supply or acquisition.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market"
    },
