      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53z",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53Z Transparency",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53z"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.526",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market instrument may include rules about a gas market\nparticipant, the Minister or the Commission publishing information\nthat relates to a gas market matter, including rules about any of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) the type of information that is published;\n\n(b) the circumstances in which information is published;\n\n(c) the manner in which information is published.\nExample: A rule requiring information to be published at specified intervals.\n\n(2) A gas market instrument may include rules requiring a gas market\nparticipant to give to another gas market participant information or\ndocuments relevant to a gas market matter.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A gas market instrument may include rules about a gas market\nparticipant, the Minister or the Commission publishing information\nthat relates to a gas market matter, including rules about any of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) the type of information that is published;\n\n(b) the circumstances in which information is published;\n\n(c) the manner in which information is published.\nExample: A rule requiring information to be published at specified intervals.\n\n(2) A gas market instrument may include rules requiring a gas market\nparticipant to give to another gas market participant information or\ndocuments relevant to a gas market matter.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53z-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53z-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c6e08d8aa902b00dad34c8629d22c2bea3e06927bcb1057c2b9887b3cd13ff40"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53z",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53Z Transparency",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 526,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market instrument may include rules about a gas market\nparticipant, the Minister or the Commission publishing information\nthat relates to a gas market matter, including rules about any of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) the type of information that is published;\n\n(b) the circumstances in which information is published;\n\n(c) the manner in which information is published.\nExample: A rule requiring information to be published at specified intervals.\n\n(2) A gas market instrument may include rules requiring a gas market\nparticipant to give to another gas market participant information or\ndocuments relevant to a gas market matter."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53z-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
