          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53z-ss-1-logic-cogai-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "de7087459b45538ed29773783862cb0e42fb2885b0a3b5d325d5ca653128db1c",
      "skos:note": "Rules about publishing information by gas market participants, the Minister, or the Commission."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53z-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53Z(1) Transparency",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 526,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market instrument may include rules about a gas market\nparticipant, the Minister or the Commission publishing information\nthat relates to a gas market matter, including rules about any of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) the type of information that is published;\n\n(b) the circumstances in which information is published;\n\n(c) the manner in which information is published.\nExample: A rule requiring information to be published at specified intervals."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53z-ss-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
