    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53za",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53ZA Reporting, records and auditing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53za"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.526",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market instrument may include rules about:\n\n(a) reporting; or\n\n(b) generating or keeping records (including financial records);\nor\n\n(c) auditing;\nrelating to a gas market matter.\n\n(2) A gas market instrument may include rules requiring a gas market\nparticipant to give:\n\n(a) financial or other reports, records or documents; or\n\n(b) information;\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nGas market instruments  Division 2\n\nSection 53ZB\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nrelating to a gas market matter to the Minister or the Commission,\nincluding requiring such reports, records, documents or\ninformation to be given periodically or on request.\n\n(3) A gas market instrument may include rules requiring a gas market\nparticipant to do any of the following:\n\n(a) report to the Minister or the Commission the occurrence of a\nspecified event relating to:\n\n(i) a gas market matter; or\n\n(ii) a price dispute;\n\n(b) give to the Minister or the Commission specified information\nrelating to such an event.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A gas market instrument may include rules about:\n\n(a) reporting; or\n\n(b) generating or keeping records (including financial records);\nor\n\n(c) auditing;\nrelating to a gas market matter.\n\n(2) A gas market instrument may include rules requiring a gas market\nparticipant to give:\n\n(a) financial or other reports, records or documents; or\n\n(b) information;\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nGas market instruments  Division 2\n\nSection 53ZB\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nrelating to a gas market matter to the Minister or the Commission,\nincluding requiring such reports, records, documents or\ninformation to be given periodically or on request.\n\n(3) A gas market instrument may include rules requiring a gas market\nparticipant to do any of the following:\n\n(a) report to the Minister or the Commission the occurrence of a\nspecified event relating to:\n\n(i) a gas market matter; or\n\n(ii) a price dispute;\n\n(b) give to the Minister or the Commission specified information\nrelating to such an event.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53za-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53za-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53za-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fc27173f3aca2453030f92461bc52b30591f785fb5fb8e78bb621a57768bdd3f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53za",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53ZA Reporting, records and auditing",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 526,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market instrument may include rules about:\n\n(a) reporting; or\n\n(b) generating or keeping records (including financial records);\nor\n\n(c) auditing;\nrelating to a gas market matter.\n\n(2) A gas market instrument may include rules requiring a gas market\nparticipant to give:\n\n(a) financial or other reports, records or documents; or\n\n(b) information;\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nGas market instruments  Division 2\n\nSection 53ZB\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\nrelating to a gas market matter to the Minister or the Commission,\nincluding requiring such reports, records, documents or\ninformation to be given periodically or on request.\n\n(3) A gas market instrument may include rules requiring a gas market\nparticipant to do any of the following:\n\n(a) report to the Minister or the Commission the occurrence of a\nspecified event relating to:\n\n(i) a gas market matter; or\n\n(ii) a price dispute;\n\n(b) give to the Minister or the Commission specified information\nrelating to such an event."
    },
