      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.526",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A gas market instrument may include rules requiring a gas market\nparticipant to do any of the following:\n\n(a) report to the Minister or the Commission the occurrence of a\nspecified event relating to:\n\n(i) a gas market matter; or\n\n(ii) a price dispute;\n\n(b) give to the Minister or the Commission specified information\nrelating to such an event.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A gas market instrument may include rules requiring a gas market\nparticipant to do any of the following:\n\n(a) report to the Minister or the Commission the occurrence of a\nspecified event relating to:\n\n(i) a gas market matter; or\n\n(ii) a price dispute;\n\n(b) give to the Minister or the Commission specified information\nrelating to such an event.",
      "values:partOf": {
