    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zb",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53ZB Conferral of powers and functions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zb"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.527",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market instrument may confer on a person or body a power\nto do, or a function of doing, any of the following:\n\n(a) monitoring compliance with a gas market instrument;\n\n(b) conducting investigations in relation to a gas market matter;\n\n(c) providing exemptions from:\n\n(i) a gas market instrument; or\n\n(ii) a specified provision of a gas market instrument; or\n\n(iii) a specified rule included in a gas market instrument;\n\n(d) reviewing, or reporting on:\n\n(i) the operation, application or administration of a gas\nmarket instrument; or\n\n(ii) activities under, or in relation to, a gas market\ninstrument;\n\n(e) reviewing a decision made under a gas market instrument, or\nin the exercise or performance of a power or function\nconferred by a gas market instrument.\n\n(2) A gas market code may confer on a person or body any of the\nfollowing powers or functions:\n\n(a) a power to determine, or a function of determining, any\nmatter that may be dealt with by a gas market code;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A gas market instrument may confer on a person or body a power\nto do, or a function of doing, any of the following:\n\n(a) monitoring compliance with a gas market instrument;\n\n(b) conducting investigations in relation to a gas market matter;\n\n(c) providing exemptions from:\n\n(i) a gas market instrument; or\n\n(ii) a specified provision of a gas market instrument; or\n\n(iii) a specified rule included in a gas market instrument;\n\n(d) reviewing, or reporting on:\n\n(i) the operation, application or administration of a gas\nmarket instrument; or\n\n(ii) activities under, or in relation to, a gas market\ninstrument;\n\n(e) reviewing a decision made under a gas market instrument, or\nin the exercise or performance of a power or function\nconferred by a gas market instrument.\n\n(2) A gas market code may confer on a person or body any of the\nfollowing powers or functions:\n\n(a) a power to determine, or a function of determining, any\nmatter that may be dealt with by a gas market code;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zb-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zb-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "873df8a0e065a1e93a565450e8bc0f8df63259d6be6fbaab249f1b35348a0de8"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zb",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53ZB Conferral of powers and functions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 527,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market instrument may confer on a person or body a power\nto do, or a function of doing, any of the following:\n\n(a) monitoring compliance with a gas market instrument;\n\n(b) conducting investigations in relation to a gas market matter;\n\n(c) providing exemptions from:\n\n(i) a gas market instrument; or\n\n(ii) a specified provision of a gas market instrument; or\n\n(iii) a specified rule included in a gas market instrument;\n\n(d) reviewing, or reporting on:\n\n(i) the operation, application or administration of a gas\nmarket instrument; or\n\n(ii) activities under, or in relation to, a gas market\ninstrument;\n\n(e) reviewing a decision made under a gas market instrument, or\nin the exercise or performance of a power or function\nconferred by a gas market instrument.\n\n(2) A gas market code may confer on a person or body any of the\nfollowing powers or functions:\n\n(a) a power to determine, or a function of determining, any\nmatter that may be dealt with by a gas market code;\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market"
    },
