    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zc",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53ZC Fees",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zc"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.528",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market instrument may provide for the charging of a fee for\nanything done by or in relation to the Commonwealth, the\nCommission or any other person or body in relation to a gas market\ninstrument, including in the exercise of a power or the performance\nof a function conferred by a gas market instrument.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nGas market instruments  Division 2\n\nSection 53ZD\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) A gas market instrument that provides for the charging of a fee\nmay deal with any of the following matters:\n\n(a) the amount of the fee, including a method for working out the\namount of the fee;\n\n(b) who is liable to pay the fee;\n\n(c) the consequences of not paying the fee;\n\n(d) when the fee becomes due and payable;\n\n(e) waiving a fee;\n\n(f) refunding a fee.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A gas market instrument may provide for the charging of a fee for\nanything done by or in relation to the Commonwealth, the\nCommission or any other person or body in relation to a gas market\ninstrument, including in the exercise of a power or the performance\nof a function conferred by a gas market instrument.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nGas market instruments  Division 2\n\nSection 53ZD\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) A gas market instrument that provides for the charging of a fee\nmay deal with any of the following matters:\n\n(a) the amount of the fee, including a method for working out the\namount of the fee;\n\n(b) who is liable to pay the fee;\n\n(c) the consequences of not paying the fee;\n\n(d) when the fee becomes due and payable;\n\n(e) waiving a fee;\n\n(f) refunding a fee.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zc-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zc-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b6f391afa9b2d022535eda5a63f00574ed37e9240c066829da121103395540f1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zc",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53ZC Fees",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 528,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market instrument may provide for the charging of a fee for\nanything done by or in relation to the Commonwealth, the\nCommission or any other person or body in relation to a gas market\ninstrument, including in the exercise of a power or the performance\nof a function conferred by a gas market instrument.\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nGas market instruments  Division 2\n\nSection 53ZD\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(2) A gas market instrument that provides for the charging of a fee\nmay deal with any of the following matters:\n\n(a) the amount of the fee, including a method for working out the\namount of the fee;\n\n(b) who is liable to pay the fee;\n\n(c) the consequences of not paying the fee;\n\n(d) when the fee becomes due and payable;\n\n(e) waiving a fee;\n\n(f) refunding a fee."
    },
    {
