    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zc-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53ZC(2) Fees",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zc-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.528",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A gas market instrument that provides for the charging of a fee\nmay deal with any of the following matters:\n\n(a) the amount of the fee, including a method for working out the\namount of the fee;\n\n(b) who is liable to pay the fee;\n\n(c) the consequences of not paying the fee;\n\n(d) when the fee becomes due and payable;\n\n(e) waiving a fee;\n\n(f) refunding a fee.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A gas market instrument that provides for the charging of a fee\nmay deal with any of the following matters:\n\n(a) the amount of the fee, including a method for working out the\namount of the fee;\n\n(b) who is liable to pay the fee;\n\n(c) the consequences of not paying the fee;\n\n(d) when the fee becomes due and payable;\n\n(e) waiving a fee;\n\n(f) refunding a fee.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zc"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zc-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zc-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8082546bd01e833a766e407a7859732d8d8d3bc25b9465e249de06ecf54280d1",
      "skos:note": "Defines matters that a gas market instrument may deal with when charging a fee."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zc-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53ZC(2) Fees",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 528,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A gas market instrument that provides for the charging of a fee\nmay deal with any of the following matters:\n\n(a) the amount of the fee, including a method for working out the\namount of the fee;\n\n(b) who is liable to pay the fee;\n\n(c) the consequences of not paying the fee;\n\n(d) when the fee becomes due and payable;\n\n(e) waiving a fee;\n\n(f) refunding a fee."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zc-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
