    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53ze",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53ZE What gas market instruments may refer to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53ze"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.531",
      "values:originalText": "Gas market instruments may refer to other instruments\n\n(1) A gas market instrument may make provision in relation to a\nmatter by applying, adopting or incorporating (with or without\nmodification) any matter contained in any other instrument or\nwriting:\n\n(a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or\n\n(b) as in force or existing from time to time.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) has effect despite subsection 14(2) of the\nLegislation Act 2003.\nOther matters\n\n(3) A gas market instrument may make provision in relation to a\nmatter (including setting a price):\n\n(a) by reference to:\n\n(i) the price of any gas commodity or other goods or\nservices anywhere inside or outside Australia; or\n\n(ii) any published information about any market (whether\ninside or outside Australia); or\n\n(b) by reference to, or by providing for, a formula or method.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "Gas market instruments may refer to other instruments\n\n(1) A gas market instrument may make provision in relation to a\nmatter by applying, adopting or incorporating (with or without\nmodification) any matter contained in any other instrument or\nwriting:\n\n(a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or\n\n(b) as in force or existing from time to time.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) has effect despite subsection 14(2) of the\nLegislation Act 2003.\nOther matters\n\n(3) A gas market instrument may make provision in relation to a\nmatter (including setting a price):\n\n(a) by reference to:\n\n(i) the price of any gas commodity or other goods or\nservices anywhere inside or outside Australia; or\n\n(ii) any published information about any market (whether\ninside or outside Australia); or\n\n(b) by reference to, or by providing for, a formula or method.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53ze-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53ze-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53ze-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b639aa76b78c1ec29440eef2c096c4c500a68a8c319d2be439c85dab241ba25c"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53ze",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53ZE What gas market instruments may refer to",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 531,
      "values:originalText": "Gas market instruments may refer to other instruments\n\n(1) A gas market instrument may make provision in relation to a\nmatter by applying, adopting or incorporating (with or without\nmodification) any matter contained in any other instrument or\nwriting:\n\n(a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or\n\n(b) as in force or existing from time to time.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) has effect despite subsection 14(2) of the\nLegislation Act 2003.\nOther matters\n\n(3) A gas market instrument may make provision in relation to a\nmatter (including setting a price):\n\n(a) by reference to:\n\n(i) the price of any gas commodity or other goods or\nservices anywhere inside or outside Australia; or\n\n(ii) any published information about any market (whether\ninside or outside Australia); or\n\n(b) by reference to, or by providing for, a formula or method.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market"
    },
