    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zi",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53ZI Powers to make legislative instruments",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zi"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.532",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A gas market instrument must not confer a power to make a\nlegislative instrument on a person or body other than:\n\n(a) a Minister; or\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nGas market instruments  Division 2\n\nSection 53ZI\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) the Commission; or\n\n(c) a member of the staff of the Commission; or\n\n(d) an APS employee; or\n\n(e) an entity covered by subsection 53K(3).\n\n(2) A gas market instrument must not confer a power to delegate a\npower to make a legislative instrument.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A gas market instrument must not confer a power to make a\nlegislative instrument on a person or body other than:\n\n(a) a Minister; or\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nGas market instruments  Division 2\n\nSection 53ZI\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) the Commission; or\n\n(c) a member of the staff of the Commission; or\n\n(d) an APS employee; or\n\n(e) an entity covered by subsection 53K(3).\n\n(2) A gas market instrument must not confer a power to delegate a\npower to make a legislative instrument.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zi-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zi-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4b66b4ef5fe51ed5b6840a1ab23bcae591304b43332d48c15c0647d7a640a405"
    },
