    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zn-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53ZN(3) Proceedings for defamation not to lie",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zn-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.538",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A court must not make an order under subsection (1) unless the\ncourt considers that the order will:\n\n(a) redress, in whole or in part, the loss or damage suffered by\nthe non-parties in relation to the contravening conduct; or\n\n(b) prevent or reduce the loss or damage suffered, or likely to be\nsuffered, by the non-parties in relation to the contravening\nconduct.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A court must not make an order under subsection (1) unless the\ncourt considers that the order will:\n\n(a) redress, in whole or in part, the loss or damage suffered by\nthe non-parties in relation to the contravening conduct; or\n\n(b) prevent or reduce the loss or damage suffered, or likely to be\nsuffered, by the non-parties in relation to the contravening\nconduct.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zn"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zn-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zn-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8088d3e75a12d86fd20877248897627cc1a94c285857187536a7c74318b55824",
      "skos:note": "Court must consider redress or prevention of loss/damage before making an order."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zn-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53ZN(3) Proceedings for defamation not to lie",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 538,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A court must not make an order under subsection (1) unless the\ncourt considers that the order will:\n\n(a) redress, in whole or in part, the loss or damage suffered by\nthe non-parties in relation to the contravening conduct; or\n\n(b) prevent or reduce the loss or damage suffered, or likely to be\nsuffered, by the non-parties in relation to the contravening\nconduct.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zn-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zn-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
