      "cml:premiseText": "Engaging in a scheme to avoid the application of a civil penalty provision is prohibited."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zq-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53ZQ(2) Schemes for avoidance purposes",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zq-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.542",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A constitutional corporation contravenes this subsection if:\n\n(a) the corporation, either alone or with other persons, engages\nin any of the following conduct:\n\n(i) enters into a scheme;\n\n(ii) begins to carry out a scheme;\n\n(iii) carries out a scheme; and\n\n(b) having regard to any matters as required under\nsubsection 53ZR(1), it would be reasonable to conclude that\nthe purpose of the corporation engaging in that conduct was\nto avoid the application of a civil penalty provision of a gas\nmarket instrument.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see section 53ZK and Part VI.\nConstitutional trade and commerce",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A constitutional corporation contravenes this subsection if:\n\n(a) the corporation, either alone or with other persons, engages\nin any of the following conduct:\n\n(i) enters into a scheme;\n\n(ii) begins to carry out a scheme;\n\n(iii) carries out a scheme; and\n\n(b) having regard to any matters as required under\nsubsection 53ZR(1), it would be reasonable to conclude that\nthe purpose of the corporation engaging in that conduct was\nto avoid the application of a civil penalty provision of a gas\nmarket instrument.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see section 53ZK and Part VI.\nConstitutional trade and commerce",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zq"
      },
