      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.542",
      "values:originalText": "(4) To avoid doubt, subsections (1), (2) and (3) are independent from\nand do not limit each other.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "(4) To avoid doubt, subsections (1), (2) and (3) are independent from\nand do not limit each other.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zq"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zq-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7a3b823ee1cd92258a6a3ba0a3e063eb7f6be13047210b7c724c0b53094962eb",
      "skos:note": "Clarifies independence of subsections (1), (2) and (3)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zq-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53ZQ(4) Schemes for avoidance purposes",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 542,
      "values:originalText": "(4) To avoid doubt, subsections (1), (2) and (3) are independent from\nand do not limit each other.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market"
    },
    {
