      "skos:prefLabel": "53ZT Commission may require person to provide information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zt"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.545",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a person is required to keep, to generate or\nto publish information or a document under a gas market\ninstrument.\n\n(2) The Commission may give the person a written notice that requires\nthe person to give the information, or to produce the document, to\nthe Commission within a specified period and in a specified\nmanner.\n\n(3) The notice must:\n\n(a) name the person to which it is given; and\n\n(b) specify:\n\n(i) the information or document to which it relates; and\n\n(ii) the provisions of the gas market instrument which\nrequire the person to keep, to generate or to publish the\ninformation or document; and\n\n(c) explain the effect of sections 53ZU, 53ZV and 53ZW.\n\n(4) The notice may relate to more than one piece of information or\nmore than one document.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if a person is required to keep, to generate or\nto publish information or a document under a gas market\ninstrument.\n\n(2) The Commission may give the person a written notice that requires\nthe person to give the information, or to produce the document, to\nthe Commission within a specified period and in a specified\nmanner.\n\n(3) The notice must:\n\n(a) name the person to which it is given; and\n\n(b) specify:\n\n(i) the information or document to which it relates; and\n\n(ii) the provisions of the gas market instrument which\nrequire the person to keep, to generate or to publish the\ninformation or document; and\n\n(c) explain the effect of sections 53ZU, 53ZV and 53ZW.\n\n(4) The notice may relate to more than one piece of information or\nmore than one document.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
