    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zu",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53ZU Extending periods for complying with notices",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zu"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.545",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person who has been given a notice under section 53ZT may, at\nany time within the period within which the person must comply\nwith the notice (as extended under any previous application of\nsubsection (2) of this section), apply in writing to the Commission\nfor an extension of the period for complying with the notice.\n\n(2) A member of the Commission may, by written notice given to the\nperson, extend the period within which the person must comply\nwith the notice.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person who has been given a notice under section 53ZT may, at\nany time within the period within which the person must comply\nwith the notice (as extended under any previous application of\nsubsection (2) of this section), apply in writing to the Commission\nfor an extension of the period for complying with the notice.\n\n(2) A member of the Commission may, by written notice given to the\nperson, extend the period within which the person must comply\nwith the notice.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zu-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zu-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bf4c3e8d1f26ad9f097f48bcca38049a6a57e23f0e7892645a4aa5dfbefd0607"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zu",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53ZU Extending periods for complying with notices",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 545,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person who has been given a notice under section 53ZT may, at\nany time within the period within which the person must comply\nwith the notice (as extended under any previous application of\nsubsection (2) of this section), apply in writing to the Commission\nfor an extension of the period for complying with the notice.\n\n(2) A member of the Commission may, by written notice given to the\nperson, extend the period within which the person must comply\nwith the notice.\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market"
    },
