      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: Agent"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zv",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53ZV Compliance with notices",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zv"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.546",
      "values:originalText": "A person that is given a notice under section 53ZT must comply\nwith it within:\n\n(a) the period specified in the notice; or\n\n(b) if the period for complying with the notice has been extended\nunder section 53ZU—the period as so extended.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see section 53ZK and Part VI.\n53ZW  False or misleading information etc.\n\n(1) A person must not, in compliance or purported compliance with a\nnotice given under section 53ZT:\n\n(a) give to the Commission false or misleading information; or\n\n(b) produce to the Commission documents that contain false or\nmisleading information.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see section 53ZK and Part VI.\n\n(2) This section does not apply to:\n\n(a) information that the person could not have known was false\nor misleading; or\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nInvestigation powers  Division 4\n\nSection 53ZX\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) the production to the Commission of a document containing\nfalse or misleading information if the document is\naccompanied by a statement of the person that the\ninformation is false or misleading.\n53ZX  This Division does not limit other provisions\n\nThis Division does not limit:\n\n(a) a provision of Division 2; or\n\n(b) section 155 (which is about the general\ninformation-gathering powers of the Commission).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "skos:definition": "A person that is given a notice under section 53ZT must comply\nwith it within:\n\n(a) the period specified in the notice; or\n\n(b) if the period for complying with the notice has been extended\nunder section 53ZU—the period as so extended.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see section 53ZK and Part VI.\n53ZW  False or misleading information etc.\n\n(1) A person must not, in compliance or purported compliance with a\nnotice given under section 53ZT:\n\n(a) give to the Commission false or misleading information; or\n\n(b) produce to the Commission documents that contain false or\nmisleading information.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see section 53ZK and Part VI.\n\n(2) This section does not apply to:\n\n(a) information that the person could not have known was false\nor misleading; or\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nInvestigation powers  Division 4\n\nSection 53ZX\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) the production to the Commission of a document containing\nfalse or misleading information if the document is\naccompanied by a statement of the person that the\ninformation is false or misleading.\n53ZX  This Division does not limit other provisions\n\nThis Division does not limit:\n\n(a) a provision of Division 2; or\n\n(b) section 155 (which is about the general\ninformation-gathering powers of the Commission).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zv-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-53zv-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5f8fadb4a6150d719be35bf173458db9a46a52c81e97d29508c27a258ff5d635"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-53zv",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53ZV Compliance with notices",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 546,
      "values:originalText": "A person that is given a notice under section 53ZT must comply\nwith it within:\n\n(a) the period specified in the notice; or\n\n(b) if the period for complying with the notice has been extended\nunder section 53ZU—the period as so extended.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see section 53ZK and Part VI.\n53ZW  False or misleading information etc.\n\n(1) A person must not, in compliance or purported compliance with a\nnotice given under section 53ZT:\n\n(a) give to the Commission false or misleading information; or\n\n(b) produce to the Commission documents that contain false or\nmisleading information.\nNote:\nFor enforcement, see section 53ZK and Part VI.\n\n(2) This section does not apply to:\n\n(a) information that the person could not have known was false\nor misleading; or\n\nProvisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.  Chapter 4\nGas market  Part IVBB\nInvestigation powers  Division 4\n\nSection 53ZX\n\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nCompilation date: 27/05/2026\n\n(b) the production to the Commission of a document containing\nfalse or misleading information if the document is\naccompanied by a statement of the person that the\ninformation is false or misleading.\n53ZX  This Division does not limit other provisions\n\nThis Division does not limit:\n\n(a) a provision of Division 2; or\n\n(b) section 155 (which is about the general\ninformation-gathering powers of the Commission).\n\nChapter 4  Provisions relating to particular industries, payment surcharges etc.\nPart IVBB  Gas market"
    },
