      "values:originalText": "(3) This subsection applies to:\n\n(a) Part IIIAA; and\n\n(b) Part IIIA; and\n\n(c) Part IVB; and\n\n(d) Part V; and\n\n(e) Part VIIA; and\n\n(f) Part XICA.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) This subsection applies to:\n\n(a) Part IIIAA; and\n\n(b) Part IIIA; and\n\n(c) Part IVB; and\n\n(d) Part V; and\n\n(e) Part VIIA; and\n\n(f) Part XICA.",
      "values:partOf": {
